134218
00:02:14,218 --> 00:02:15,928
我叫小鬼。
My name is Gudo.

136011
00:02:16,011 --> 00:02:18,722
我曾经是一名灵魂守护者。
I used to be a Soul Keeper.

140224
00:02:20,224 --> 00:02:23,811
我的工作是护送
My job was to escort

143894
00:02:23,894 --> 00:02:26,438
刚刚逝去的灵魂前往转世之地。
newly deceased souls to their rebirth.

146814
00:02:26,814 --> 00:02:31,402
但后来，我的职责发生了变化。
But my duty changed later on.

154738
00:02:34,738 --> 00:02:38,784
每一位逝去的灵魂都会被指派一名灵魂守护者。
Every departed soul is assigned a Soul Keeper.

158909
00:02:38,909 --> 00:02:42,496
当他们终于能够放下尘世牵挂，
When they can finally let go of the human world,

162621
00:02:42,621 --> 00:02:46,292
将双手交托给我们时……
with their hands in ours...

167501
00:02:47,501 --> 00:02:51,547
我们会引领他们沿着湖畔前往米山。
we shepherd them along the lake to Mount Mi.

172298
00:02:52,298 --> 00:02:55,926
在那里，他们将留下自己的记忆。
There, they will leave their memories behind.

179179
00:02:59,179 --> 00:03:01,640
当他们穿过瀑布……
After they pass through the waterfall...

181932
00:03:01,932 --> 00:03:04,685
便会转世重生。
They will be reincarnated.

187021
00:03:07,021 --> 00:03:11,108
瀑布会冲走他们灵魂的大部分。
The waterfall washes away much of their souls.

191275
00:03:11,275 --> 00:03:14,987
剩下的部分会化作一根绳索。
What remains will transform into a rope.

195195
00:03:15,195 --> 00:03:17,865
绳索上通常会有结。
There are usually knots on the rope.

198032
00:03:18,032 --> 00:03:21,827
这些结代表着他们一生中未解的怨恨。
These knots represent their life's unresolved resentments.

207166
00:03:27,166 --> 00:03:30,002
我不知道什么是“未解的怨恨”，
I don't know what "unresolved resentments" are,

210169
00:03:30,169 --> 00:03:35,549
但我知道它们会积聚成邪恶的种子。
but I do know that they accumulate into seeds of evil.

218844
00:03:38,844 --> 00:03:41,513
这些种子潜藏在他们的体内，
The seeds hide inside their bodies

221597
00:03:41,597 --> 00:03:44,683
直到被愤怒与仇恨释放出来。
until they are unleashed by rage and hatred.

224767
00:03:44,767 --> 00:03:48,437
将人类变成可怕的“愤怒”……
Turning humans into terrifying Wraths...

228520
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:51,398
送我回去，他需要我！
Send me back, he needs me!

231482
00:03:51,482 --> 00:03:54,068
但我认为人类比这更复杂。
But I think humans are more complicated than that.

234151
00:03:54,151 --> 00:03:58,155
邪恶的种子未必会毁灭他们。
Seeds of evil won't necessarily destroy them.

238280
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:02,284
它们甚至可能推动人类生存下去。
They may even push humans to survive.

244203
00:04:04,203 --> 00:04:05,496
请问……
Excuse me...

245579
00:04:05,579 --> 00:04:08,332
你见过一个大概这么高的小孩吗？
Have you seen a little kid about this tall?

248415
00:04:08,415 --> 00:04:09,166
没有。
No.

249249
00:04:09,249 --> 00:04:12,378
我和弟弟走散了，你能帮帮我吗？
My brother and I got separated, can you help me?

252461
00:04:12,461 --> 00:04:13,587
弟弟？
Brother?

253671
00:04:13,671 --> 00:04:15,923
为什么你们不能就这样分开呢？
Why can't you just stay separated?

256215
00:04:16,215 --> 00:04:17,716
因为他是我的弟弟啊！
Because he's my little brother!

257800
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:21,136
他和我一样有一头绿发，而且他……
He's got green hair like me, and he...

261220
00:04:21,220 --> 00:04:26,392
有一天，我遇见了一个名叫小妹的女孩。
One day, I met a girl named Yuri.

266850
00:04:26,850 --> 00:04:29,186
她并不知道自己已经去世，
Not realizing she has died,

269520
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:33,190
却坚持要寻找走失的弟弟。
she insisted on finding her lost brother.

273607
00:04:33,607 --> 00:04:36,276
好吧，我会陪你一起寻找。
Okay, I'll join you on your search.

324950
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:27,369
不好意思，让一让。
Excuse me, coming through.

330414
00:05:30,414 --> 00:05:32,124
她怎么会在这里露面？
Why is she showing her face here?

332207
00:05:32,207 --> 00:05:34,043
嘘！她会听见我们的！
Shh! She'll hear us!

356523
00:05:56,523 --> 00:05:57,983
父亲！
Father!

359526
00:05:59,526 --> 00:06:02,821
莫克将军，怎么只有您一个人？我父亲在哪里？
General Mok, why is it only you? Where is my father?

376502
00:06:16,502 --> 00:06:20,047
国王驾崩了，国王万岁！
The King is dead, long live the King!

380923
00:06:20,923 --> 00:06:22,883
国王是在战场上阵亡的吗？
The King died in battle?

382966
00:06:22,966 --> 00:06:24,593
花之城会怎样？
What will happen to Flower City?

384676
00:06:24,676 --> 00:06:26,678
我听说他是被自己人杀害的。
I heard that he was killed by one of his own.

386762
00:06:26,762 --> 00:06:29,890
怎么可能？谁敢杀害国王？
How could it be? How can anyone kill the King?

393811
00:06:33,811 --> 00:06:36,855
我们还要继续对抗尼尔吗？
Are we still going to fight Nyer?

396939
00:06:36,939 --> 00:06:40,150
没有王后和国王，我们怎么能赢？
How can we win without a queen and a king?

400609
00:06:40,609 --> 00:06:42,736
这是古兰的诅咒造成的吗？
Is this caused by Goran's curse?

403570
00:06:43,570 --> 00:06:45,864
王后在出生时就去世了。
The Queen died when she was born.

405948
00:06:45,948 --> 00:06:49,409
真不敢相信这竟是花之城的覆灭。
I can't believe this is Flower City's downfall.

410202
00:06:50,202 --> 00:06:52,621
也许她不会成为王位继承人。
Maybe she won't be the heir to the throne.

412871
00:06:52,871 --> 00:06:55,874
陛下从来都不希望她插手政事。
His Majesty never wanted her to handle politics.

415958
00:06:55,958 --> 00:06:59,294
如果她登基，花之城是否就走到了尽头？
If she takes the throne, will it be the end of Flower City?

430097
00:07:10,097 --> 00:07:11,348
殿下，
Your Highness,

431431
00:07:11,431 --> 00:07:12,641
国王真的打算……
did the King truly mean to...

432724
00:07:12,724 --> 00:07:15,102
把王位传给那个受诅咒的女儿吗？
pass his throne to his cursed daughter?

435602
00:07:15,602 --> 00:07:16,854
你……
You...

437104
00:07:17,104 --> 00:07:17,896
殿下，
Your Highness,

437980
00:07:17,980 --> 00:07:19,481
您还好吗？
are you all right?

460335
00:07:40,335 --> 00:07:42,838
你在干什么？放开我！
What are you doing? Let me go!

476059
00:07:56,059 --> 00:07:57,686
怎么了，尹叔叔？
What's wrong, Uncle Yin?

478437
00:07:58,437 --> 00:07:59,188
古兰，
Goran,

479271
00:07:59,271 --> 00:08:02,149
我们在国王的帐篷里发现了这把匕首！
we found this dagger in the King's tent!

482232
00:08:02,232 --> 00:08:05,235
莫将军，是你用这把匕首杀害了国王吗？
General Mok, did you murder the King with your dagger?

485319
00:08:05,319 --> 00:08:06,612
我没有杀他！
I didn't kill him!

486695
00:08:06,695 --> 00:08:08,655
殷叔，怎么可能是莫将军呢？
Uncle Yin, How could it be General Mok?

488739
00:08:08,739 --> 00:08:09,883
这一定是误会。
It must be a misunderstanding.

489907
00:08:09,907 --> 00:08:13,243
古兰，大家都知道莫将军是尼尔人。
Goran, everyone knows General Mok is from Nyer.

493327
00:08:13,327 --> 00:08:15,495
我要杀了这个叛徒，
I will kill this traitor and

495579
00:08:15,579 --> 00:08:17,206
并在他的葬礼上为我兄长报仇！
avenge my brother at his funeral!

497331
00:08:17,331 --> 00:08:21,335
公爵，葬礼可不是篡夺王位的场所！
Duke, a funeral is no place to usurp the throne!

501460
00:08:21,460 --> 00:08:24,254
你没资格说话，弑君者！
You're in no position to speak, kingslayer!

504338
00:08:24,338 --> 00:08:25,714
把他带走处决！
Take him away and execute him!

505797
00:08:25,797 --> 00:08:27,007
是，陛下！
Yes, sire!

507174
00:08:27,174 --> 00:08:28,926
放开我！我是清白的！
Let me go! I'm innocent!

509009
00:08:29,009 --> 00:08:30,445
——真不敢相信是他。——放开我！
-I can't believe it's him. -Let me go!

510469
00:08:30,469 --> 00:08:31,803
国王曾如此信任他。
The King trusted him so.

511887
00:08:31,887 --> 00:08:33,305
他该不会有同谋吧？
Could he have accomplices?

513388
00:08:33,388 --> 00:08:35,641
你可以骗个小女孩，
You can deceive a little girl,

515724
00:08:35,724 --> 00:08:38,060
但骗不了我！
but you can't deceive me!

518352
00:08:38,352 --> 00:08:41,063
在调查清楚之前不能杀了他！
You can't kill him before an investigation!

521146
00:08:41,146 --> 00:08:42,731
你到底想干什么？
What are you trying to do?

522814
00:08:42,814 --> 00:08:44,274
这是我父亲的葬礼。
This is my father's funeral.

524358
00:08:44,358 --> 00:08:45,984
让开！
Step aside!

526068
00:08:46,068 --> 00:08:48,654
古兰，我正试图
Goran, I am trying to

528737
00:08:48,737 --> 00:08:50,197
——为国王报仇！——放开我！
-avenge the King! -Let me go!

530280
00:08:50,280 --> 00:08:53,242
放开我，给我让开！
Let me go and back off!

533367
00:08:53,367 --> 00:08:55,911
这绝不是我父亲所愿！
This is not what my father would want!

551510
00:09:11,510 --> 00:09:12,761
殿下！
Your Highness!

552928
00:09:12,928 --> 00:09:14,805
殿下，怎么了？
Your Highness, what's wrong?

574449
00:09:34,449 --> 00:09:36,118
健二！
Kenji!

579079
00:09:39,079 --> 00:09:42,874
健二……
Kenji...

583166
00:09:43,166 --> 00:09:46,586
我叫小妹，你叫什么名字？
My name is Yuri, what's your name?

587254
00:09:47,254 --> 00:09:48,839
我叫小鬼。
I'm Gudo.

589214
00:09:49,214 --> 00:09:51,967
小鬼，这里是什么地方？
Gudo, what is this place?

592050
00:09:52,050 --> 00:09:53,927
我很担心我弟弟。
I'm worried about my little brother.

594011
00:09:54,011 --> 00:09:55,887
这里是异世界。
This is Another World.

595971
00:09:55,971 --> 00:09:58,932
-我会帮你找到你弟弟的。 -健二！
-I'll help you find your brother. -Kenji!

607816
00:10:07,816 --> 00:10:11,528
小鬼，你也是像我一样迷路才来到这里的吗？
Gudo, are you here because you're lost like me?

612487
00:10:12,487 --> 00:10:15,991
不，我住在这里。
No, I live here.

623290
00:10:23,290 --> 00:10:25,292
那我们一定能找到我弟弟！
Then we'll definitely find my brother!

628462
00:10:28,462 --> 00:10:31,089
在我遇到的所有灵魂中……
Among all the souls I've met...

631298
00:10:31,298 --> 00:10:36,803
她是第一个没有因恐惧而哭泣，反而展露笑容的人。
she's the first one who smiles instead of crying in fear.

636887
00:10:36,887 --> 00:10:38,055
健二！
Kenji!

638138
00:10:38,138 --> 00:10:42,267
她经常使用一些我从未听过的词语……
She often uses words I've never heard of...

642392
00:10:42,392 --> 00:10:44,144
比如……
Words like...

644895
00:10:44,895 --> 00:10:49,441
“思念”、“离别”和“饥饿”。
"longing," "parting" and "hungry."

649900
00:10:49,900 --> 00:10:52,277
我完全不知道这些词是什么意思。
I don't know any of those words.

652861
00:10:52,861 --> 00:10:54,196
-我觉得…… -健二！
-I think... -Kenji!

654279
00:10:54,279 --> 00:10:55,947
-我们必须找到健二…… -健二！
-we have to find Kenji... -Kenji!

656031
00:10:56,031 --> 00:10:58,492
否则她就会跟着我转世了。
Before she'll follow me to reincarnation.

662120
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:04,331
另一个世界太大了。
Another World is too big.

664414
00:11:04,414 --> 00:11:06,625
根本不可能找到健二。
It's impossible to find Kenji.

666708
00:11:06,708 --> 00:11:09,961
我需要休息一下。
I need a break.

670587
00:11:10,587 --> 00:11:12,964
小鬼，你不累吗？
Gudo, don't you get tired?

673173
00:11:13,173 --> 00:11:14,883
“累”是什么意思？
What is "tired"?

682265
00:11:22,265 --> 00:11:24,559
你听到那个声音了吗？
Can you hear that?

685060
00:11:25,060 --> 00:11:27,020
你什么意思？
What do you mean?

689064
00:11:29,064 --> 00:11:31,358
我肚子饿了。
My tummy's hungry.

691608
00:11:31,608 --> 00:11:34,403
我想家！
I miss my family!

694778
00:11:34,778 --> 00:11:37,114
她总是提起她的家人。
She talks about her family all the time.

697197
00:11:37,197 --> 00:11:40,325
妈妈做的饭真好吃！
Mommy's food is so yummy!

700826
00:11:40,826 --> 00:11:42,828
当她累的时候……
When she's tired...

702911
00:11:42,911 --> 00:11:45,205
-健二，你在哪里？-她就会说肚子饿了。
-Kenji, where are you? -she'd say her tummy's hungry.

705288
00:11:45,288 --> 00:11:47,749
我想回家吃饭！
I want to go home and eat!

710544
00:11:50,544 --> 00:11:54,339
她想找到健二，
She wants to find Kenji,

714423
00:11:54,423 --> 00:11:57,092
这样她的家人就能再次一起吃饭了。
so her family can eat together again.

718218
00:11:58,218 --> 00:12:01,555
她会在肚子上画个圈圈。
She'd draw a loop on her tummy.

722139
00:12:02,139 --> 00:12:05,517
她说那代表“肚子饿了”。
She said it means "her tummy's hungry."

729771
00:12:09,771 --> 00:12:14,067
我不记得自己有过家人。
I don't remember having a family.

734568
00:12:14,568 --> 00:12:17,112
我该怎么拥有一个“家人”呢？
How do I get a "family"?

742117
00:12:22,117 --> 00:12:25,871
为什么由里对
Why does Yuri see

746788
00:12:26,788 --> 00:12:29,624
“另一个世界”的看法如此不同？
Another World so differently?

750375
00:12:30,375 --> 00:12:34,337
与众不同是一种什么感觉？
How does it feel to be different?

756214
00:12:36,214 --> 00:12:40,343
人类世界是什么样的？
What is the human realm like?

765474
00:12:45,474 --> 00:12:46,683
公主，您还好吗？
Princess, are you alright?

766766
00:12:46,766 --> 00:12:48,393
殿下，您没事吧？
Your Highness, are you OK?

770353
00:12:50,353 --> 00:12:52,147
我还活着吗？
Am I still alive?

772230
00:12:52,230 --> 00:12:55,192
当然，公主，别傻了。
Of course, Princess, don't be silly.

775525
00:12:55,525 --> 00:12:57,611
我父亲怎么样了？
How about my father?

779821
00:12:59,821 --> 00:13:02,365
都给我滚！全都滚！
Leave! All of you!

785410
00:13:05,410 --> 00:13:08,538
我听说莫克将军想篡夺王位。
I heard General Mok wanted to usurp the throne.

792375
00:13:12,375 --> 00:13:15,086
公主，听我说！莫克将军是清白的。
Princess, listen to me! General Mok is innocent.

795170
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:17,589
是敌人的刺客干的！
An enemy assassin did it!

799883
00:13:19,883 --> 00:13:20,883
古兰！
Goran!

801092
00:13:21,092 --> 00:13:23,428
听着，时间不多了！
Listen, there's not much time!

803678
00:13:23,678 --> 00:13:24,513
你什么意思？
What do you mean?

804596
00:13:24,596 --> 00:13:27,432
数千名尼尔军队正驻扎在我们城外10公里处。
Thousands of Nyer troops are stationed 10 kilometers outside our city.

807516
00:13:27,516 --> 00:13:28,558
据我们的间谍报告，
According to our spy,

808642
00:13:28,642 --> 00:13:30,352
莫克将军计划刺杀国王，
General Mok planned to kill the King

810435
00:13:30,435 --> 00:13:31,686
并与尼尔勾结。
and colluded with Nyer.

811770
00:13:31,770 --> 00:13:33,146
他想让花之城陷落。
He wants Flower City to fall.

813897
00:13:33,897 --> 00:13:36,608
公主殿下，请让我处决他！
Princess, let me execute him!

816691
00:13:36,691 --> 00:13:38,860
我没有杀国王！
I didn't kill the King!

819444
00:13:39,444 --> 00:13:42,989
我父亲教导过我，要给他人留有余地。
My father taught me about giving benefit of the doubt.

823073
00:13:43,073 --> 00:13:45,033
我觉得我们应该调查清楚……
I think we should investigate...

825116
00:13:45,116 --> 00:13:47,118
现在不是犹豫的时候！
This is no time to hesitate!

827202
00:13:47,202 --> 00:13:49,454
我会代表你去参加简报会。
I'll attend the briefing on your behalf.

829538
00:13:49,538 --> 00:13:50,872
我们必须反击。
We have to fight back.

830956
00:13:50,956 --> 00:13:53,792
你明白吗？
Do you understand?

835085
00:13:55,085 --> 00:13:58,713
花之城需要一位有能力的领导者。
Flower City needs a capable leader.

838797
00:13:58,797 --> 00:14:01,299
希望你能理解。
I hope you understand.

855689
00:14:15,689 --> 00:14:16,731
古兰公主。
Princess Goran.

857357
00:14:17,357 --> 00:14:18,733
你对我父亲做了什么？
What did you do to my father?

863572
00:14:23,572 --> 00:14:25,115
为什么杀了他？
Why did you kill him?

865198
00:14:25,198 --> 00:14:26,575
我没有做那种事。
I did no such thing.

866658
00:14:26,658 --> 00:14:28,785
那到底是谁干的？
Then who did it?

877669
00:14:37,669 --> 00:14:40,672
为什么没人告诉我真相？
Why isn't anyone telling me the truth?

881464
00:14:41,464 --> 00:14:43,967
我不在乎你是否与尼尔勾结。
I don't care whether you're colluding with Nyer.

884050
00:14:44,050 --> 00:14:46,720
我只想知道我父亲发生了什么。
I just want to know what happened to my father.

887262
00:14:47,262 --> 00:14:48,638
如果他去了另一个世界，
If he's gone to Another World,

888722
00:14:48,722 --> 00:14:50,890
我该怎么找到他？
how do I find him?

892017
00:14:52,017 --> 00:14:55,353
公主殿下，花之城现在需要您坚强起来。
Princess, Flower City needs you to be strong now.

896730
00:14:56,730 --> 00:14:58,857
陛下……
His Majesty...

899649
00:14:59,649 --> 00:15:01,610
他是自杀的！
he took his own life!

902152
00:15:02,152 --> 00:15:03,403
什么？！
What?!

903486
00:15:03,486 --> 00:15:05,697
他再也无法忍受伤痛了……
He couldn't bear his injuries any longer...

905780
00:15:05,780 --> 00:15:07,115
不可能！绝不可能……
Impossible! That can't be...

907198
00:15:07,198 --> 00:15:08,992
返回花城的路途太遥远了。
The journey back to the city was too long.

909075
00:15:09,075 --> 00:15:10,201
闭嘴！你在撒谎！
Shut up! You're lying!

910285
00:15:10,285 --> 00:15:12,579
他为什么要抛弃花城？
Why would he abandon Flower City?

912996
00:15:12,996 --> 00:15:14,289
他不想回来吗？
He didn't want to return?

914372
00:15:14,372 --> 00:15:15,600
公主殿下，我不是那个意思！
Princess, that's not what I meant!

915624
00:15:15,624 --> 00:15:16,875
闭嘴！
Shut up!

917250
00:15:17,250 --> 00:15:19,586
他宁可牺牲生命也要保卫国家！
He would die to defend his nation!

919669
00:15:19,669 --> 00:15:21,212
他绝不会自杀……
He'd never kill himself...

921296
00:15:21,296 --> 00:15:22,607
——他是在保卫国家…… ——闭嘴！
-He was defending his nation... -Shut up!

922631
00:15:22,631 --> 00:15:23,381
你也是。
And you as well.

923465
00:15:23,465 --> 00:15:25,175
所以他……希望你能理解。
That's why he... I hope you understand.

925258
00:15:25,258 --> 00:15:26,760
骗子！
Liar!

937854
00:15:37,854 --> 00:15:41,191
父亲，你到底怎么了？
What happened to you, Father?

942359
00:15:42,359 --> 00:15:45,612
现在你们都走了，我孤身一人……
Now that you're both gone, I'm all alone...

946154
00:15:46,154 --> 00:15:48,365
我该怎么办？
What am I to do?

951534
00:15:51,534 --> 00:15:54,371
是我杀了母亲和父亲吗？！
Did I kill Mother and you?!

954871
00:15:54,871 --> 00:15:57,248
花之城不需要我。
I'm not wanted here in Flower City.

957332
00:15:57,332 --> 00:16:00,335
我是你们两人的负担，对吧？
I'm a burden to you both, right?

964255
00:16:04,255 --> 00:16:06,257
我不该出生在这个世上。
I shouldn't have been born.

981272
00:16:21,272 --> 00:16:23,608
父亲绝不会抛弃花之城。
Father would never abandon Flower City.

983817
00:16:23,817 --> 00:16:26,152
莫克将军和尹叔叔……
General Mok and Uncle Yin...

986653
00:16:26,653 --> 00:16:29,030
他们可能都在说谎……
they could both be lying...

989114
00:16:29,114 --> 00:16:31,366
父亲，你会怎么做？
Father, what would you do?

993702
00:16:33,702 --> 00:16:35,578
我不是命令你离开了吗？
Didn't I order you to leave?

997497
00:16:37,497 --> 00:16:38,707
什么？
What?

999541
00:16:39,541 --> 00:16:40,917
嗨，古兰。
Hi, Goran.

1001292
00:16:41,292 --> 00:16:43,503
你是什么？是人还是鬼？
What are you? Human or ghost?

1003586
00:16:43,586 --> 00:16:46,715
我是小鬼，来自另一个世界。
I am Gudo, I'm from Another World.

1006923
00:16:46,923 --> 00:16:48,091
另一个世界……？
Another World...?

1008174
00:16:48,174 --> 00:16:51,970
你是灵魂守护者吗？你要带我走吗？
Are you a Soul Keeper? Are you taking me away?

1012762
00:16:52,762 --> 00:16:56,975
我曾经是一名灵魂守护者，负责将逝者的灵魂送往转世之地。
I was once a Soul Keeper who took deceased souls to their rebirth.

1017058
00:16:57,058 --> 00:16:59,018
但现在我有另一项使命。
But I have another duty now.

1019102
00:16:59,102 --> 00:17:00,979
那么……我死了吗？
Then... have I died?

1021062
00:17:01,062 --> 00:17:04,607
如果你死了，就不会出现在人类世界了。
You wouldn't be here in the human world if you had died.

1024691
00:17:04,691 --> 00:17:06,401
那你为什么在这里？
Then why are you here?

1026484
00:17:06,484 --> 00:17:08,236
你要带走我父亲吗？
Are you taking my father away?

1028319
00:17:08,319 --> 00:17:10,363
他已经死了。他在另一个世界。
He's dead. He's in Another World.

1030447
00:17:10,447 --> 00:17:11,865
那带我去另一个世界！
Then take me to Another World!

1031948
00:17:11,948 --> 00:17:13,283
我需要我父亲！
I need my father!

1033366
00:17:13,366 --> 00:17:15,618
现在只有他才能拯救花之城。
Only he can save Flower City now.

1035702
00:17:15,702 --> 00:17:17,412
我愿意用我的生命来换取他的生命！
I will trade my life for his!

1037495
00:17:17,495 --> 00:17:20,623
花之城需要的是他，而不是我。
Flower City needs him, not me.

1040790
00:17:20,790 --> 00:17:22,167
为什么？
Why?

1042333
00:17:22,333 --> 00:17:24,210
你又没杀过人。
You didn't kill anyone.

1046838
00:17:26,838 --> 00:17:28,214
你懂什么？
What do you know?

1049382
00:17:29,382 --> 00:17:32,969
你母亲是在分娩时去世的，
Your mother died during childbirth,

1053052
00:17:33,052 --> 00:17:35,680
但这并不算你杀了她。
but you didn't kill your mother.

1056306
00:17:36,306 --> 00:17:37,891
你为什么在这里？
Why are you here?

1063396
00:17:43,396 --> 00:17:44,731
我肚子饿了。
My tummy's hungry.

1064814
00:17:44,814 --> 00:17:45,815
什么？
What?

1070028
00:17:50,028 --> 00:17:52,405
吃完就走！
Leave after you're done!

1081998
00:18:01,998 --> 00:18:03,625
我吃饱了。
I'm full.

1083917
00:18:03,917 --> 00:18:05,752
那快滚！
Then beat it!

1085919
00:18:05,919 --> 00:18:09,297
我吃饱了！作为回报，我可以帮你一个忙。
I'm full! I can grant you a favor in return.

1090006
00:18:10,006 --> 00:18:11,925
我该相信尹叔叔吗？
Should I trust Uncle Yin?

1092008
00:18:12,008 --> 00:18:13,092
我不知道。
I don't know.

1093176
00:18:13,176 --> 00:18:15,303
那莫克将军是在说谎吗？
Did General Mok lie, then?

1095386
00:18:15,386 --> 00:18:16,930
他为什么要这么做？
Why would he do that?

1097013
00:18:17,013 --> 00:18:20,809
人间世事难以捉摸，
The human world is unfathomable,

1100892
00:18:20,892 --> 00:18:22,894
你只能继续前行。
you can only keep marching on.

1102977
00:18:22,977 --> 00:18:25,230
你在说什么？
What are you on about?

1105313
00:18:25,313 --> 00:18:27,565
我不明白。
I don't understand.

1107649
00:18:27,649 --> 00:18:30,485
我可以带你回到过去的某个时刻。
I can take you back to a moment in the past.

1110568
00:18:30,568 --> 00:18:32,987
过去的某个时刻？
A moment in the past?

1114364
00:18:34,364 --> 00:18:39,369
你能看到已经发生过的事情。
You can see something that has already happened.

1119452
00:18:39,452 --> 00:18:42,080
那带我去父亲去世前的那个时刻。
Then take me to the moment before Father died.

1122163
00:18:42,163 --> 00:18:45,083
我需要看看是谁杀了他。
I need to see who murdered him.

1125583
00:18:45,583 --> 00:18:46,960
好吧。
All right.

1173381
00:19:33,381 --> 00:19:34,757
父亲！
Father!

1176968
00:19:36,968 --> 00:19:38,386
古兰！
Goran!

1189898
00:19:49,898 --> 00:19:52,984
——就是他！真的是他！——古兰，别走！
-It's him! It's really him! -Goran, don't go!

1194819
00:19:54,819 --> 00:19:57,196
小鬼，让她过去。
Gudo, let her through.

1197280
00:19:57,280 --> 00:19:59,657
我要一击击杀这个“愤怒”！
I'll kill this Wrath in one blow!

1199741
00:19:59,741 --> 00:20:02,035
黑天，等等！
Dark Sky, wait!

1202118
00:20:02,118 --> 00:20:03,912
要我说的话，
If you ask me,

1203995
00:20:03,995 --> 00:20:06,039
我真搞不懂你为什么磨磨蹭蹭的。
I've no idea why you're dawdling.

1206122
00:20:06,122 --> 00:20:06,998
让开。
Out of my way.

1207081
00:20:07,081 --> 00:20:09,459
黑天，住手！
Dark Sky, stop!

1209709
00:20:09,709 --> 00:20:11,753
这里不是你做主的地方！
You're not in charge here!

1212003
00:20:12,003 --> 00:20:14,172
让开！
Step aside!

1215089
00:20:15,089 --> 00:20:16,341
父亲！
Father!

1217634
00:20:17,634 --> 00:20:18,760
父亲！
Father!

1219260
00:20:19,260 --> 00:20:20,470
是他杀了我父亲！
He killed my father!

1220553
00:20:20,553 --> 00:20:22,722
-不！ -我定要让他付出代价！
-No! -I'll make him pay!

1225850
00:20:25,850 --> 00:20:27,226
放开我！
Let me go!

1231856
00:20:31,856 --> 00:20:33,232
古兰！
Goran!

1234233
00:20:34,233 --> 00:20:35,902
古兰，振作起来！
Goran, pull yourself together!

1235985
00:20:35,985 --> 00:20:37,236
振作起来！
Pull yourself together!

1237320
00:20:37,320 --> 00:20:39,656
那并不是全部真相。
That's not the whole truth.

1239739
00:20:39,739 --> 00:20:41,240
你必须继续观察。
You have to keep watching.

1241324
00:20:41,324 --> 00:20:42,325
醒醒，古兰！
Wake up, Goran!

1242408
00:20:42,408 --> 00:20:44,202
小鬼，别再保护那个“愤怒”了！
Gudo, stop protecting that Wrath!

1244285
00:20:44,285 --> 00:20:46,579
她没有邪恶之角！她还不是“愤怒”！
She has no evil horn! She's not a Wrath yet!

1246663
00:20:46,663 --> 00:20:48,831
我快成功了……
I'm so close...

1248915
00:20:48,915 --> 00:20:50,208
快成功什么？
Close to what?

1250291
00:20:50,291 --> 00:20:52,377
拔出她的邪恶之种？
Pulling her seed of evil?

1252460
00:20:52,460 --> 00:20:55,254
小鬼，她已经看清了真相。
Gudo, she's seen the truth.

1255338
00:20:55,338 --> 00:20:57,757
你改变不了任何事！
You can't change anything!

1260009
00:21:00,009 --> 00:21:01,719
如果我找到她的结，
If I find her knots,

1261803
00:21:01,803 --> 00:21:04,430
我就能拔出那颗邪恶之种！
I can pull the seed of evil!

1264847
00:21:04,847 --> 00:21:06,599
我快成功了！
I'm close!

1267225
00:21:07,225 --> 00:21:09,769
你无法阻止人类的仇恨！
You can't stop human hatred!

1269894
00:21:09,894 --> 00:21:12,814
一旦邪恶之种发芽，就为时已晚！
Once the seed of evil grows, it's too late!

1273606
00:21:13,606 --> 00:21:14,816
让开！
Get out of my way!

1275316
00:21:15,316 --> 00:21:16,359
三！
Three!

1276442
00:21:16,442 --> 00:21:17,360
二！
Two!

1277443
00:21:17,443 --> 00:21:18,443
一！
One!

1278820
00:21:18,820 --> 00:21:21,656
依我看，那些体内有邪恶之种的人，已经算是“愤怒”了。
If you ask me, those with seeds of evil are Wraths already.

1281739
00:21:21,739 --> 00:21:23,199
他们无非是灾难！
They are nothing but disasters!

1283282
00:21:23,282 --> 00:21:24,867
他们并非天生如此！
They're not born this way!

1285284
00:21:25,284 --> 00:21:28,162
邪恶之种的生长自有其原因！
A seed of evil grows for a reason!

1288246
00:21:28,246 --> 00:21:31,874
天女说过，在邪恶之种长出犄角之前……
The Goddess said that before the seed grows horns...

1291958
00:21:31,958 --> 00:21:34,961
我还能救她！而你不能伤害她！
I can still help her! And you cannot hurt her!

1295044
00:21:35,044 --> 00:21:36,379
就是他……
It's him...

1297046
00:21:37,046 --> 00:21:38,756
是他杀了我父亲……
He killed my father...

1299215
00:21:39,215 --> 00:21:41,968
他该死……我要报仇！
He deserves to die... I want revenge!

1304178
00:21:44,178 --> 00:21:45,178
古兰！
Goran!

1305888
00:21:45,888 --> 00:21:49,225
古兰，醒醒！你还没看清全部真相！
Goran, wake up! You haven't seen the whole truth yet!

1309434
00:21:49,434 --> 00:21:50,852
让开！
Out of my way!

1315815
00:21:55,815 --> 00:21:59,027
这都是因为你是“愤怒”！
This is because you're a Wrath!

1324198
00:22:04,198 --> 00:22:05,700
大功告成。
That's a wrap.

1334208
00:22:14,208 --> 00:22:16,002
小鬼！
Gudo!

1347138
00:22:27,138 --> 00:22:28,181
咦？
Huh?

1361319
00:22:41,319 --> 00:22:43,279
我们为什么在这里？
Why are we here?

1363362
00:22:43,362 --> 00:22:45,448
我要带你去见天女。
I'm taking you to the Goddess.

1365573
00:22:45,573 --> 00:22:46,657
天女？
The Goddess?

1366741
00:22:46,741 --> 00:22:48,993
她对“异世界”了如指掌。
She knows everything about Another World.

1369077
00:22:49,077 --> 00:22:51,871
她会知道去哪里找你的弟弟。
She will know where to find your brother.

1395978
00:23:15,978 --> 00:23:18,523
这些是什么？
What are these?

1400024
00:23:20,024 --> 00:23:22,485
当逝去的灵魂转世时，
When deceased souls reincarnate,

1402777
00:23:22,777 --> 00:23:25,321
会留下这些绳索。
they leave behind these ropes.

1405571
00:23:25,571 --> 00:23:29,700
这些是他们在“异世界”留下的唯一痕迹。
These are the only things they leave behind in Another World.

1410118
00:23:30,118 --> 00:23:33,121
为什么绳子上会有结？
Why are there knots on the ropes?

1413204
00:23:33,204 --> 00:23:36,374
每个人心中都怀揣着遗憾……
Everyone carries regrets...

1416499
00:23:36,499 --> 00:23:39,460
以及未消散的愤怒。
and unresolved rage.

1419544
00:23:39,544 --> 00:23:44,632
积累过多就会形成邪恶的种子。
Accumulating too much will form seeds of evil.

1424715
00:23:44,715 --> 00:23:46,384
邪恶的种子？
Seeds of evil?

1427135
00:23:47,135 --> 00:23:49,971
拥有邪恶种子的人会怎样？
What happens to those with seeds of evil?

1430054
00:23:50,054 --> 00:23:52,390
万物皆受平衡法则支配。
Balance rules all things.

1432807
00:23:52,807 --> 00:23:55,685
当邪恶的种子潜藏在人的心中……
When a seed of evil hides in a human's heart...

1436394
00:23:56,394 --> 00:23:58,813
他们要么变成“愤怒”……
they either become a Wrath...

1439313
00:23:59,313 --> 00:24:02,275
要么变成一道光。
or a light ray.

1442358
00:24:02,358 --> 00:24:03,651
我们要解开这个结，
We untie the knot

1443734
00:24:03,734 --> 00:24:07,446
以尽量减少“愤怒”造成的伤害。
to minimize the damage caused by Wraths.

1448823
00:24:08,823 --> 00:24:10,533
让我解释一下，天女！
Let me explain, Goddess!

1450616
00:24:10,616 --> 00:24:11,969
小鬼说她还不是“愤怒”，
Gudo said that she isn't a Wrath yet,

1451993
00:24:11,993 --> 00:24:14,120
但她的种子已经发芽了。
but her seed's sprouted.

1454203
00:24:14,203 --> 00:24:17,623
他对我施展了法力！
He used his powers on me!

1457707
00:24:17,707 --> 00:24:20,001
恕我直言，他另有图谋！
No offense, but he has ulterior motives!

1460084
00:24:20,084 --> 00:24:21,919
我攻击她只是为了我们大家的利益。
I only attacked her for our own good.

1462003
00:24:22,003 --> 00:24:24,255
要我说，我从来不信任人类。
If you ask me, I never trust humans.

1464338
00:24:24,338 --> 00:24:26,340
我才不在乎她有没有犄角。
I don't care if she has horns.

1466424
00:24:26,424 --> 00:24:28,676
我杀“愤怒”已经多年了，
I've been killing Wraths for years,

1468759
00:24:28,759 --> 00:24:30,887
而且我确信古兰迟早会变成“愤怒”！
and I'm sure that Goran will become a Wrath!

1470970
00:24:30,970 --> 00:24:32,138
黑天，
Dark Sky,

1472221
00:24:32,221 --> 00:24:36,184
你还记得你保护小鬼的承诺吗？
do you remember your promise to protect Gudo?

1476267
00:24:36,267 --> 00:24:39,395
我记得，但要我说的话……
I do, but if you ask me...

1479478
00:24:39,478 --> 00:24:42,648
黑天，先别说话。
Dark Sky, stop speaking for a minute.

1496621
00:24:56,621 --> 00:24:57,621
小鬼。
Gudo.

1498289
00:24:58,289 --> 00:24:59,290
你还有机会……
You can still...

1499373
00:24:59,373 --> 00:25:00,791
我必须救她。
I have to save her.

1500875
00:25:00,875 --> 00:25:02,335
我向她许过诺。
I promised her.

1503044
00:25:03,044 --> 00:25:06,881
种子中蕴含的仇恨与愤怒……
The hatred and anger contained in a seed...

1506964
00:25:06,964 --> 00:25:09,383
足以改变一个人的本性。
can change one's nature.

1509467
00:25:09,467 --> 00:25:10,676
你确定你能做到吗？
Are you sure you can do this?

1510760
00:25:10,760 --> 00:25:11,886
我相信她。
I believe in her.

1512720
00:25:12,720 --> 00:25:14,513
我会留在人类世界。
I will stay in the human world.

1516682
00:25:16,682 --> 00:25:18,517
我能拔出她体内的邪恶之种。
I can pull her seed of evil.

1518601
00:25:18,601 --> 00:25:21,604
她的犄角还没长出来，她不会变成“愤怒者”。
Her horns haven't grown, she won't become a Wrath.

1522897
00:25:22,897 --> 00:25:26,108
如果你对人类抱有信心，
If you have faith in humanity,

1526275
00:25:26,275 --> 00:25:30,029
就必须亲眼见证接下来发生的事。
you must witness what happens next.

1530696
00:25:30,696 --> 00:25:32,531
要成功做到这一点，
To pull this off,

1532615
00:25:32,615 --> 00:25:36,744
你必须理解人性与时机。
you must understand human nature and timing.

1547046
00:25:47,046 --> 00:25:49,674
花之城现在需要一位有能力的领袖……
Flower City needs a capable leader now...

1549757
00:25:49,757 --> 00:25:51,384
而那个人绝不会是你！
and it won't be you!

1551634
00:25:51,634 --> 00:25:53,469
莫克将军或许杀了国王，
General Mok might have killed the King.

1553594
00:25:53,594 --> 00:25:56,347
但真正的凶手是你！
But you are the real murderer!

1576909
00:26:16,909 --> 00:26:18,035
别这样，殿下！
Don't do it, Your Highness!

1617116
00:26:57,116 --> 00:27:00,953
很久以前，花之城曾有一位受诅咒的公主。
Once upon a time, Flower City had a cursed princess.

1621454
00:27:01,454 --> 00:27:04,582
当她得知父亲遇害时，
When she learned that her father was killed,

1624707
00:27:04,707 --> 00:27:09,420
她的愤怒迫使“愤怒”将毁灭之力与她分享。
Her anger compelled the Wrath to share his destructive power with her.

1630004
00:27:10,004 --> 00:27:11,756
为了复仇，
For the sake of vengeance,

1632298
00:27:12,298 --> 00:27:17,178
黑暗在一夜之间笼罩了花之城。
darkness overtook Flower City overnight.

1639513
00:27:19,513 --> 00:27:23,559
城中所有的花朵都凋零了。
All the flowers in the city withered.

1645978
00:27:25,978 --> 00:27:29,648
她因此被称为“幽灵公主”。
She became known as the "Ghost Princess."

1651192
00:27:31,192 --> 00:27:36,155
她失踪后不久，花之城便被征服了。
Soon after she went missing, Flower City was conquered.

1657114
00:27:37,114 --> 00:27:40,034
再也没有人见过“幽灵公主”。
No one ever saw the "Ghost Princess" again.

1661202
00:27:41,202 --> 00:27:43,579
失去了“幽灵公主”，
Without the "Ghost Princess,"

1663704
00:27:43,704 --> 00:27:46,374
花之城变成了麦村。
Flower City became Wheat Village.

1687520
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:09,063
“愤怒”大人……
Wrath, my lord...

1689230
00:28:09,230 --> 00:28:11,565
请将您的力量赐予我吧。
please share your power with me.

1691649
00:28:11,649 --> 00:28:15,319
时候到了！我们再也等不下去了！
It's time! We can't wait anymore!

1696153
00:28:16,153 --> 00:28:18,697
今年的收成惨不忍睹。
This year's harvest has been disastrous.

1698781
00:28:18,781 --> 00:28:21,909
记住，为尼尔（Nyer）贡献力量是你们的荣幸。
Remember, it is your privilege to contribute to Nyer.

1701992
00:28:21,992 --> 00:28:25,955
你们必须在明天中午之前上交一半的收成。
You must submit half your harvest by noon tomorrow.

1706622
00:28:26,622 --> 00:28:28,916
任何人若谎报收成——
Anyone who lies about your harvest,

1709083
00:28:29,083 --> 00:28:30,251
这种事以前就发生过——
which has happened before,

1710793
00:28:30,793 --> 00:28:33,254
头颅必将落地！
your head will roll!

1735359
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:56,402
在偷懒吗？
Slacking off?

1738112
00:28:58,112 --> 00:29:01,323
起来干活！立刻！
Get up and work! Now!

1741407
00:29:01,407 --> 00:29:02,783
现在就起来！
Get up now!

1744994
00:29:04,994 --> 00:29:06,287
现在就起来，听见了吗？
Get up now, you hear me?

1746370
00:29:06,370 --> 00:29:08,831
别装死，你这混蛋！
Don't play dead, you bastard!

1748914
00:29:08,914 --> 00:29:11,083
起来！马上！
Get up! Right now!

1751167
00:29:11,167 --> 00:29:11,959
将军！
General!

1752042
00:29:12,042 --> 00:29:14,587
如果您拿走一半的收成，我们过不了这个冬天！
We won't survive winter if you take half the harvest!

1754670
00:29:14,670 --> 00:29:16,714
求您开恩吧！
Please have mercy!

1778986
00:29:38,986 --> 00:29:42,364
强，你要去哪儿？是要上山吗？
Keung, where are you going? Headed up the mountain?

1782781
00:29:42,781 --> 00:29:45,493
你为什么要去山上？那里都积雪了！
Why are you going up? It's covered in snow!

1785576
00:29:45,576 --> 00:29:46,368
我去找食物！
I'm off to find food!

1786452
00:29:46,452 --> 00:29:48,013
你是去安魂寺吧？！
You're off to Requiem Temple, aren't you?!

1788037
00:29:48,037 --> 00:29:50,915
别去！他们会杀光你全家的！
Don't go! They'll kill your family!

1790998
00:29:50,998 --> 00:29:53,334
他们现在就在杀我们啊！
They're already killing us!

1794502
00:29:54,502 --> 00:29:55,878
别去，强！
Don't go, Keung!

1795961
00:29:55,961 --> 00:29:58,756
那里有可怕的“鬼手”！
There's a scary "ghost hand" there!

1798839
00:29:58,839 --> 00:30:03,135
就算你遇到了“怒神”又怎样？
So what if you find a Wrath?

1803219
00:30:03,219 --> 00:30:04,678
你会害死我们所有人的。
You'll get us all killed.

1804762
00:30:04,762 --> 00:30:06,388
我们不能就这样坐以待毙！
We can't just wait for death!

1806472
00:30:06,472 --> 00:30:09,058
我们连温饱都成问题，他们却要拿走一半。
They want half when we barely have enough.

1809141
00:30:09,141 --> 00:30:10,893
情况只会越来越糟！
It'll only get worse!

1811101
00:30:11,101 --> 00:30:13,020
这三十年里，日子只变得越来越难过了。
Life's only become harder the last 30 years.

1813062
00:30:13,062 --> 00:30:16,398
你熬不过这个冬天。
You won't survive the winter.

1816482
00:30:16,482 --> 00:30:18,776
我要去安魂寺，
I'll go to Requiem Temple and

1818859
00:30:18,859 --> 00:30:20,277
求“怒神”让我变得可怕。
ask the Wrath to make me fearsome.

1820402
00:30:20,402 --> 00:30:21,403
那样我就能逼他们……
Then I can force them...

1821487
00:30:21,487 --> 00:30:24,156
打开谷仓，把我们的粮食还回来！
to open the barn and return our food!

1824240
00:30:24,240 --> 00:30:25,157
段……
Duan...

1825241
00:30:25,241 --> 00:30:29,161
强是為了整个小麦村才这么做的。
Keung is doing this for all of Wheat Village.

1829245
00:30:29,245 --> 00:30:32,498
你或许没有勇气战斗，但别拦着他。
You may not have the courage to fight, but don't hold him back.

1832581
00:30:32,581 --> 00:30:35,334
如果他被抓到，我们全都完了。
If he gets caught, we're all dead.

1835417
00:30:35,417 --> 00:30:38,671
你或许不在乎自己的性命，但想想其他人吧！
You may not care about your life, but think of the others!

1848222
00:30:48,222 --> 00:30:49,222
我的小女儿。
My little girl.

1851600
00:30:51,600 --> 00:30:52,476
妈妈！
Mama!

1852560
00:30:52,560 --> 00:30:53,727
爸爸要去哪里？
Where is Papa going?

1853811
00:30:53,811 --> 00:30:54,937
我们回家吧。
Let's go home.

1855020
00:30:55,020 --> 00:30:56,772
放你爸爸走吧。
Let your father go.

1857690
00:30:57,690 --> 00:30:59,525
你不能吃这个！
You can't eat this!

1859608
00:30:59,608 --> 00:31:01,402
会肚子疼的。
It'll hurt your tummy.

1873247
00:31:13,247 --> 00:31:14,498
“愤怒”可不是闹着玩的！
A Wrath's no joke!

1874582
00:31:14,582 --> 00:31:15,457
喂！
Hey!

1875541
00:31:15,541 --> 00:31:17,668
回来！
Come back!

1908782
00:31:48,782 --> 00:31:50,034
小鬼。
Gudo.

1910242
00:31:50,242 --> 00:31:52,411
我闻到这里有“愤怒”的气息。
I can smell a Wrath here.

1938562
00:32:18,562 --> 00:32:22,066
天女，你能帮小妹找到她弟弟吗？
Goddess, can you help Yuri find her brother?

1942149
00:32:22,149 --> 00:32:25,903
小鬼，你的职责是引导亡灵转世。
Gudo, your job is to guide deceased souls to their reincarnation.

1945986
00:32:25,986 --> 00:32:28,489
你为什么要帮她找弟弟？
Why are you helping her find her brother?

1948572
00:32:28,572 --> 00:32:30,282
求求你帮帮我！
Please help me!

1959333
00:32:39,333 --> 00:32:41,794
他是怎么走丢的？
How did he get lost?

1961877
00:32:41,877 --> 00:32:45,798
他四天前失踪了。
He went missing four days ago.

1967800
00:32:47,800 --> 00:32:50,969
小鬼，我赐予你
Gudo, I'm granting you

1971595
00:32:51,595 --> 00:32:54,556
洞察过去的力量。
the power to see the past.

1974640
00:32:54,640 --> 00:32:57,976
这样你就能帮小妹找到她的弟弟了。
You'll be able to help Yuri find her brother.

1978060
00:32:58,060 --> 00:33:02,398
不过，你只能看到过去，无法改变它。
However, you can only see the past, you cannot change it.

2084917
00:34:44,917 --> 00:34:48,170
愤怒之神，我的主！求您帮帮我们！
Wrath, my lord! Please help us!

2088253
00:34:48,253 --> 00:34:49,630
我们别无选择！
We've no other way!

2089713
00:34:49,713 --> 00:34:51,548
请把我变成“愤怒”吧！
Please turn me into a Wrath!

2094885
00:34:54,885 --> 00:34:56,929
你为什么要成为“愤怒”？
Why would you want to be a Wrath?

2097429
00:34:57,429 --> 00:34:58,429
“愤怒”大人！
Wrath, my lord!

2099348
00:34:59,348 --> 00:35:02,142
我是小鬼，不是“愤怒”！
I am Gudo, not a Wrath!

2102559
00:35:02,559 --> 00:35:04,770
小鬼大人！
Lord Gudo!

2104853
00:35:04,853 --> 00:35:06,897
我想成为凶残的“愤怒”！
I want to be a vicious Wrath!

2106980
00:35:06,980 --> 00:35:10,400
那样我就能吓唬那些混蛋，救下所有人！
Then I can scare those bastards and save everyone!

2111109
00:35:11,109 --> 00:35:14,321
你为什么要救所有人？
Why do you have to save everyone?

2114696
00:35:14,696 --> 00:35:16,740
实话实说，大人，
The truth is, my lord,

2116824
00:35:16,824 --> 00:35:18,158
我们已经走投无路了。
we're at our wits' end.

2118242
00:35:18,242 --> 00:35:20,285
如果我不挺身而出，还有谁会？
If I don't step up, who will?

2120369
00:35:20,369 --> 00:35:21,995
为什么非得是“愤怒”不可？
Why must it be a Wrath?

2122079
00:35:22,079 --> 00:35:23,723
我必须像“幽灵公主”那样令人畏惧，
I must be as fearsome as the Ghost Princess

2123747
00:35:23,747 --> 00:35:25,457
才能吓退那些混蛋。
to scare those bastards.

2125541
00:35:25,541 --> 00:35:27,376
“幽灵公主”？
"Ghost Princess"?

2127459
00:35:27,459 --> 00:35:29,503
你是说古兰公主吗？
Do you mean Princess Goran?

2129586
00:35:29,586 --> 00:35:31,964
是的，我听说她是个“愤怒”，
Yes, I heard that she's a Wrath

2132047
00:35:32,047 --> 00:35:34,174
杀光了所有背叛她的人。
who killed all who betrayed her.

2134258
00:35:34,258 --> 00:35:37,553
她不是“愤怒”，她只是个女孩。
She was not a Wrath, she was just a girl.

2137970
00:35:37,970 --> 00:35:40,973
一个不幸的女孩。
An unfortunate girl.

2141056
00:35:41,056 --> 00:35:42,933
幽灵公主！
Ghost Princess!

2143016
00:35:43,016 --> 00:35:45,143
你就是“愤怒”！
You're a Wrath!

2145227
00:35:45,227 --> 00:35:48,814
公主为什么要这样对待我们？
Why is the Princess doing this to us?

2161201
00:36:01,201 --> 00:36:03,120
我在做什么？
What am I doing?

2164162
00:36:04,162 --> 00:36:07,583
古兰，如果你愿意，
Goran, if you want,

2167749
00:36:07,749 --> 00:36:10,252
我们可以再回去。
we can go back again.

2171169
00:36:11,169 --> 00:36:13,005
我想见我父亲。
I want to see my father.

2193400
00:36:33,400 --> 00:36:34,651
快走……
Leave...

2195277
00:36:35,277 --> 00:36:38,071
在他们赶到之前。
before they get here.

2198530
00:36:38,530 --> 00:36:39,323
陛下！
Your Majesty!

2199406
00:36:39,406 --> 00:36:42,326
让我留下来。尼尔的军队马上就到。
Let me stay behind. Nyer's army will arrive soon.

2202409
00:36:42,409 --> 00:36:43,827
如果您回到花之城，
If you return to Flower City,

2203911
00:36:43,911 --> 00:36:45,245
就能得到帮助。
you can get help.

2205537
00:36:45,537 --> 00:36:48,165
只有一个办法……
There's only one way...

2208248
00:36:48,248 --> 00:36:50,584
用我的尸体拖延时间……
Use my corpse to stall for time...

2210667
00:36:50,667 --> 00:36:52,502
我会送你回家的！
I'll get you home!

2212586
00:36:52,586 --> 00:36:54,087
陛下，请坚强！
Your Majesty, stay strong!

2214546
00:36:54,546 --> 00:36:56,757
古兰正在花之城等你。
Goran is waiting for you in Flower City.

2216840
00:36:56,840 --> 00:36:59,259
整个国家都需要你！
The whole nation needs you!

2223972
00:37:03,972 --> 00:37:05,766
带古兰走远一点！
Take Goran far away!

2225849
00:37:05,849 --> 00:37:06,892
陛下！
Your Majesty!

2227434
00:37:07,434 --> 00:37:10,145
医生！
Doctor!

2235734
00:37:15,734 --> 00:37:16,985
父亲！
Father!

2237527
00:37:17,527 --> 00:37:18,946
父亲！
Father!

2239529
00:37:19,529 --> 00:37:21,698
父亲，为什么？
Father, why?

2242991
00:37:22,991 --> 00:37:23,991
父亲！
Father!

2249164
00:37:29,164 --> 00:37:31,375
别死，父亲！
Don't die, Father!

2257965
00:37:37,965 --> 00:37:39,466
古兰。
Goran.

2266598
00:37:46,598 --> 00:37:49,059
你已经看清了真相……
You've seen the truth...

2269142
00:37:49,142 --> 00:37:51,603
为什么没用？
Why isn't it working?

2278151
00:37:58,151 --> 00:38:00,529
走……跑……
Go... ran...

2311560
00:38:31,560 --> 00:38:36,565
你母亲在你出生前就病了。
Your mother was ill even before she gave birth to you.

2318066
00:38:38,066 --> 00:38:40,902
你的诞生就是我们的奇迹。
Your birth was our miracle.

2321737
00:38:41,737 --> 00:38:46,742
被诅咒的是这个地方，不是你。
The cursed one is this place, not you.

2327075
00:38:47,075 --> 00:38:50,370
请原谅我，我始终无法从你母亲的离世中走出来，
Forgive me for never getting over your mother,

2330495
00:38:50,495 --> 00:38:53,874
也没能好好照顾你。
and failing to take good care of you.

2333957
00:38:53,957 --> 00:38:56,501
活下去，
Stay alive,

2336585
00:38:56,585 --> 00:39:00,464
这样你才能保护你的族人。
so you can protect your people.

2341923
00:39:01,923 --> 00:39:05,802
我知道这些年来你一直很努力……
I know you've tried hard all these years...

2346011
00:39:06,011 --> 00:39:07,804
我知道的。
I know that.

2417249
00:40:17,249 --> 00:40:19,543
烧掉尸体！马上！
Burn the corpses! Now!

2419626
00:40:19,626 --> 00:40:20,669
是，长官！
Yes, sir!

2434266
00:40:34,266 --> 00:40:35,892
我把这支箭头带回家好吗？
Should I take this arrowhead home?

2435976
00:40:35,976 --> 00:40:37,018
行。
Yeah.

2440272
00:40:40,272 --> 00:40:41,982
——别靠近！——走开！
-Don't come closer! -Go away!

2450323
00:40:50,323 --> 00:40:53,326
快去躲起来！马上！
Go hide! Right now!

2458415
00:40:58,415 --> 00:41:00,625
一定还有别的办法……
There must be another way...

2460709
00:41:00,709 --> 00:41:01,918
我得去找尹叔叔，
I need to find Uncle Yin,

2462002
00:41:02,002 --> 00:41:04,671
然后我们就能阻止尼尔，拯救花城。
then we'll stop Nyer and save Flower City.

2464754
00:41:04,754 --> 00:41:06,506
我们一定能行。
We can do it.

2469718
00:41:09,718 --> 00:41:11,261
我们一定能行……
We can do it...

2471428
00:41:11,428 --> 00:41:12,428
我需要……我需要……
I need... I need to...

2489654
00:41:29,654 --> 00:41:31,198
小鬼，你在干什么？
Gudo, what are you doing?

2491281
00:41:31,281 --> 00:41:33,325
你的唯一任务就是拔出她体内的邪恶种子。
Your only mission is to pull her seed of evil.

2493408
00:41:33,408 --> 00:41:37,579
但为什么她的生活没有变得更好呢？
But why didn't her life change for the better?

2498538
00:41:38,538 --> 00:41:41,041
无论她有没有邪恶种子，
Whether or not she has a seed of evil,

2501124
00:41:41,124 --> 00:41:43,126
她的人生都掌握在自己手中……
her life is in her own hands...

2503210
00:41:43,210 --> 00:41:45,253
这与你无关。
You have nothing to do with it.

2505629
00:41:45,629 --> 00:41:52,385
不知为何，我感觉自己的心碎了。
For some odd reason, I sense my heart shattering.

2515222
00:41:55,222 --> 00:41:57,974
小鬼，大人？大人？
Gudo, my lord? My lord?

2520644
00:42:00,644 --> 00:42:01,978
哦。
Oh.

2522103
00:42:02,103 --> 00:42:04,105
你还在犹豫
Are you still deciding

2524189
00:42:04,189 --> 00:42:07,025
要不要把我变成可怕的“愤怒”吗？
whether to turn me into a scary Wrath?

2527234
00:42:07,234 --> 00:42:09,945
成为“愤怒”并非你想象的那样。
Being a Wrath is not what you think.

2530237
00:42:10,237 --> 00:42:12,572
古兰不是“愤怒”，
Goran was not a Wrath,

2532656
00:42:12,656 --> 00:42:14,282
你也不是。
and neither are you.

2534366
00:42:14,366 --> 00:42:17,577
“愤怒”只会带来悲剧！
Wraths bring nothing but tragedies!

2537827
00:42:17,827 --> 00:42:21,456
你知道“幽灵之手”背后的故事吗？
Do you know the story behind the "Ghost Hand"?

2541539
00:42:21,539 --> 00:42:24,459
那一定属于一个凶残的“愤怒”。
It must've belonged to a fierce Wrath.

2544709
00:42:24,709 --> 00:42:28,797
那是个走投无路的“愤怒”。
He was a desperate Wrath.

2549172
00:42:29,172 --> 00:42:31,883
你知道这是谁的血吗？
Do you know whose blood this is?

2552259
00:42:32,259 --> 00:42:35,136
我带你回到300年前，
I'll take you 300 years into the past,

2555220
00:42:35,220 --> 00:42:38,098
让你亲眼看看。
so you can see it yourself.

2558431
00:42:38,431 --> 00:42:42,644
到时候你再决定是否还想成为“愤怒”。
Then you can decide whether you still want to become a Wrath.

2562727
00:42:42,727 --> 00:42:45,063
您说什么都行，大人。
Anything you say, my lord.

2565146
00:42:45,146 --> 00:42:46,189
但是……
But...

2566273
00:42:46,273 --> 00:42:47,274
但是什么？
But what?

2572112
00:42:52,112 --> 00:42:54,364
我肚子饿了。
My tummy's hungry.

2576324
00:42:56,324 --> 00:42:57,075
真的吗？
Seriously?

2577158
00:42:57,158 --> 00:43:00,620
我身上没带任何食物……
I don't have any food on me...

2583331
00:43:03,331 --> 00:43:04,958
等等，这让我想起来了……
Wait, that reminds me...

2585041
00:43:05,041 --> 00:43:06,721
说来也怪，我来这儿的路上发现了这个。
Weird enough, I found this on my way here.

2588420
00:43:08,420 --> 00:43:09,921
我分你一半。
I'll give you half.

2601558
00:43:21,558 --> 00:43:26,229
姜，请记住你是谁……
Keung, please remember who...

2606354
00:43:26,354 --> 00:43:28,648
以及你是什么。
and what you are.

2612444
00:43:32,444 --> 00:43:34,654
为了村子的安全，
For the village's safety,

2615363
00:43:35,363 --> 00:43:38,408
你不能带走祭品。
you cannot take away the sacrifices.

2618491
00:43:38,491 --> 00:43:39,868
我女儿不是祭品！
My daughter is not a sacrifice!

2619951
00:43:39,951 --> 00:43:41,911
你怎么能杀害自己人？
How can you kill one of your own?

2622037
00:43:42,037 --> 00:43:44,331
抓住他！
Catch him!

2624414
00:43:44,414 --> 00:43:48,084
想想整个村子，别只顾着自己！
Think of the entire village, not just yourself!

2628168
00:43:48,168 --> 00:43:50,587
别杀我们，求求你……
Don't kill us, please...

2634591
00:43:54,591 --> 00:43:58,428
爸爸！爸爸变成怪物了！
Papa! Papa has become a monster!

2639512
00:43:59,512 --> 00:44:01,639
我们的祈祷被应允了！
Our prayers are answered!

2641723
00:44:01,723 --> 00:44:04,517
“愤怒”降临了！
The Wrath is here!

2644601
00:44:04,601 --> 00:44:07,145
他会拯救我们脱离这场战火！
He will save us from the battle!

2656196
00:44:16,196 --> 00:44:18,698
不，“愤怒”大人，别攻击我们！
No, Lord Wrath, don't attack us!

2658782
00:44:18,782 --> 00:44:20,116
救命！
Help!

2662452
00:44:22,452 --> 00:44:23,203
卫兵！
Guards!

2663286
00:44:23,286 --> 00:44:25,497
哈！活该！
Ha! Serves you right!

2667582
00:44:27,582 --> 00:44:29,918
把另一只胳膊也砍掉！
Cut the other arm, too!

2672629
00:44:32,629 --> 00:44:34,672
放开我！
Let me go!

2675882
00:44:35,882 --> 00:44:37,050
我跑不动了……
I can't run anymore...

2681304
00:44:41,304 --> 00:44:44,265
爸爸？爸爸！
Papa? Papa!

2684766
00:44:44,766 --> 00:44:46,226
不！
No!

2687352
00:44:47,352 --> 00:44:49,604
住手！那是你的女儿！
Stop! That's your daughter!

2689687
00:44:49,687 --> 00:44:50,855
到底发生了什么？
What is happening?

2690939
00:44:50,939 --> 00:44:52,732
成为“愤怒”并非你们所想的那样。
Being a Wrath is not what you think.

2692816
00:44:52,816 --> 00:44:53,983
这种事不会发生在我身上，
This won't happen to me,

2694067
00:44:54,067 --> 00:44:56,861
我能控制住自己。
I can control myself.

2696945
00:44:56,945 --> 00:44:59,781
“愤怒”无法停止杀戮……
Wraths cannot stop killing...

2699864
00:44:59,864 --> 00:45:02,367
直到他们的邪恶犄角被砍掉为止。
until their evil horns are chopped off.

2706246
00:45:06,246 --> 00:45:07,997
我认得自己的女儿！
I'll recognize my own daughter!

2708081
00:45:08,081 --> 00:45:09,541
这种事绝不会发生在我身上！
This won't happen to me!

2709624
00:45:09,624 --> 00:45:14,295
我能救我的家人！
I can save my family!

2719175
00:45:19,175 --> 00:45:21,636
那个“愤怒”意志力太薄弱了！
That Wrath had weak willpower!

2721719
00:45:21,719 --> 00:45:23,221
这种事绝不会发生在我身上！
It won't happen to me!

2723304
00:45:23,304 --> 00:45:27,058
除了我，没人能救我的家人。
No one but me can save my family.

2727684
00:45:27,684 --> 00:45:28,893
小鬼大人……
Lord Gudo...

2728977
00:45:28,977 --> 00:45:30,854
请把我变成“愤怒”吧……
please turn me into a Wrath...

2730937
00:45:30,937 --> 00:45:35,066
我绝不会忘记我的家人！
I won't forget my family!

2735150
00:45:35,150 --> 00:45:35,942
小鬼！
Gudo!

2736025
00:45:36,025 --> 00:45:37,025
住手！
Stop!

2745076
00:45:45,076 --> 00:45:47,829
我早就告诉过你这里有个“愤怒”……
I told you there's a Wrath here...

2759466
00:45:59,466 --> 00:46:01,593
段？！
Duan?!

2767515
00:46:07,515 --> 00:46:09,184
太慢了！
Too slow!

2780028
00:46:20,028 --> 00:46:23,531
我要砍掉你那对邪恶的犄角！该死啦！
I'll chop off your evil horns! Time to die!

2797086
00:46:37,086 --> 00:46:39,464
原来你还有两把刷子。
So you've got some moves after all.

2805762
00:46:45,762 --> 00:46:47,055
强！
Keung!

2812268
00:46:52,268 --> 00:46:55,522
一定还有别的办法！
There must be another way!

2826950
00:47:06,950 --> 00:47:08,993
别得意忘形了！
Don't get carried away!

2862860
00:47:42,860 --> 00:47:45,697
小鬼，别再睡了，快来帮忙！
Gudo, stop sleeping and come help!

2866531
00:47:46,531 --> 00:47:48,449
如果现在不杀掉这个“愤怒”，
If we don't kill this Wrath now,

2868533
00:47:48,533 --> 00:47:50,243
另一个世界将遭受苦难。
Another World will suffer.

2870326
00:47:50,326 --> 00:47:52,537
如果他的受害者灵魂全都飘向另一个世界，
If his victims' souls all drift to Another World,

2872620
00:47:52,620 --> 00:47:55,290
可能会诞生更多的“愤怒”！
it may create more Wraths!

2875748
00:47:55,748 --> 00:47:57,750
我有个主意。
I have an idea.

2878126
00:47:58,126 --> 00:48:00,795
但我们只有一次机会。
But we only have one shot at it.

2883047
00:48:03,047 --> 00:48:05,008
我也能尖叫！
I can scream, too!

2911200
00:48:31,200 --> 00:48:33,453
别说我从来没帮过你！
Don't say I never help you!

2949364
00:49:09,364 --> 00:49:10,740
安！
Ann!

2959415
00:49:19,415 --> 00:49:22,293
安，抓住我的手！
Ann, take my hand!

2977225
00:49:37,225 --> 00:49:38,643
卡拉！
Kara!

2979936
00:49:39,936 --> 00:49:41,813
抓紧了！
Hold on tight!

2983356
00:49:43,356 --> 00:49:45,233
爸爸，帮帮我们！
Help us, Dad!

3059348
00:50:59,348 --> 00:51:00,767
段……
Duan...

3071194
00:51:11,194 --> 00:51:13,237
——卡拉！——段！
-Kara! -Duan!

3073362
00:51:13,362 --> 00:51:14,447
爸爸！
Dad!

3082497
00:51:22,497 --> 00:51:23,998
小鬼大人……
Gudo, my lord...

3085583
00:51:25,583 --> 00:51:27,460
您是说……
are you telling me that...

3087710
00:51:27,710 --> 00:51:30,171
变成“愤怒”也救不了我们吗？
turning into a Wrath won't save us?

3092298
00:51:32,298 --> 00:51:34,884
我该怎么办？
What should I do?

3102934
00:51:42,934 --> 00:51:46,938
如果小麦村团结起来，我们或许还有一线生机……
If Wheat Village bands together, we may stand a chance...

3107021
00:51:47,021 --> 00:51:48,731
姜！
Keung!

3109816
00:51:49,816 --> 00:51:52,193
你在哪儿？快回来！
Where are you? Come back!

3112276
00:51:52,276 --> 00:51:53,986
让我们团结起来！
Let's get them together!

3114153
00:51:54,153 --> 00:51:56,280
夺回属于我们的东西！
We'll reclaim what we deserve!

3117490
00:51:57,490 --> 00:51:58,991
小鬼大人……
Lord Gudo...

3120117
00:52:00,117 --> 00:52:03,120
我不想变成“愤怒”了，我想保持人形！
I'm done with becoming a Wrath, I want to stay human!

3123955
00:52:03,955 --> 00:52:06,707
我想和大家一起夺回我们的食物！
I want to reclaim our food with the others!

3145101
00:52:25,101 --> 00:52:27,854
小鬼大人，您在哪里？
Lord Gudo, where are you?

3150857
00:52:30,857 --> 00:52:32,358
小鬼大人！
Lord Gudo!

3152441
00:52:32,441 --> 00:52:36,904
答应我，不要把我变成“愤怒”！
Promise me you won't turn me into a Wrath!

3161325
00:52:41,325 --> 00:52:43,536
你太软弱了，小鬼。
You're weak, Gudo.

3163619
00:52:43,619 --> 00:52:46,956
我早就告诉过你，这里不止一个“愤怒”！
I told you there's more than one Wrath out here!

3167164
00:52:47,164 --> 00:52:52,169
“愤怒”的数量永远不会超过人类的邪念。
The number of Wraths will never exceed human's evil thoughts.

3172753
00:52:52,753 --> 00:52:54,589
他们自食其果。
They reap what they sow.

3174672
00:52:54,672 --> 00:52:57,508
真不知道姜会怎样。
I wonder what will happen to Keung.

3177592
00:52:57,592 --> 00:53:00,720
小鬼，他不过是个凡人，
Gudo, he's a mere mortal

3180803
00:53:00,803 --> 00:53:02,179
终将迎来不可避免的结局。
who will reach an inevitable end.

3182263
00:53:02,263 --> 00:53:05,016
我不知道你为什么会……
I don't know why you're being...

3185391
00:53:05,391 --> 00:53:07,685
不管这是什么……
whatever this is...

3188060
00:53:08,060 --> 00:53:10,521
我们曾立下誓约……
We made a pact...

3190605
00:53:10,605 --> 00:53:11,981
为了什么而立下契约？
A pact for what?

3192064
00:53:12,064 --> 00:53:14,066
又昏过去了？
Passed out again?

3195526
00:53:15,526 --> 00:53:17,904
有我在，你算走运了！
You're lucky you've got me!

3202366
00:53:22,366 --> 00:53:23,993
打开谷仓！
Open the barn!

3204243
00:53:24,243 --> 00:53:25,828
堕落的渣滓！
Corrupted scum!

3206203
00:53:26,203 --> 00:53:27,788
打开谷仓！
Open the barn!

3208080
00:53:28,080 --> 00:53:29,498
堕落的渣滓！
Corrupted scum!

3209874
00:53:29,874 --> 00:53:31,375
打开谷仓！
Open the barn!

3211751
00:53:31,751 --> 00:53:33,169
堕落的渣滓！
Corrupted scum!

3213586
00:53:33,586 --> 00:53:35,004
打开谷仓！
Open the barn!

3215463
00:53:35,463 --> 00:53:36,631
堕落的渣滓！
Corrupted scum!

3226933
00:53:46,933 --> 00:53:50,519
大人，所有农民都来了。
My lord, all the peasants have come.

3231646
00:53:51,646 --> 00:53:53,272
退后！
Stay back!

3234190
00:53:54,190 --> 00:53:56,817
你们若再向前一步，我就杀了他！
If you take one step forward, I'll kill him!

3240237
00:54:00,237 --> 00:54:01,656
放箭！
Fire the arrows.

3245034
00:54:05,034 --> 00:54:06,577
求求你们停手！
Please stop!

3246661
00:54:06,661 --> 00:54:07,870
你们会杀死自己人！
You'll kill one of your own!

3247954
00:54:07,954 --> 00:54:09,330
先救我！
Save me first!

3265221
00:54:25,221 --> 00:54:28,599
我砍下自己的手臂就是为了向你们证明，
I cut off my own arm to show you

3269183
00:54:29,183 --> 00:54:31,268
这并非“愤怒”的手臂！
that it is not a Wrath's arm!

3271352
00:54:31,352 --> 00:54:33,020
它不该属于安魂神殿！
It doesn't belong in Requiem Temple!

3273187
00:54:33,187 --> 00:54:35,106
我想向所有人证明……
I want to show everybody...

3275189
00:54:35,189 --> 00:54:37,858
今天我失去的不仅仅是一条手臂。
I lost more than an arm today.

3278359
00:54:38,359 --> 00:54:40,403
我们还失去了无数挚爱……
We also lost countless loved ones...

3280486
00:54:40,486 --> 00:54:42,238
以及那些饿死的人！
and those who died of hunger!

3283155
00:54:43,155 --> 00:54:44,949
我们站在你们面前……
We stand before you...

3285032
00:54:45,032 --> 00:54:47,910
作为小麦村最后的农夫。
as the last farmers of Wheat Village.

3287994
00:54:47,994 --> 00:54:49,829
我们团结一致，为共同的目标……
We're united for a common cause...

3289912
00:54:49,912 --> 00:54:52,331
夺回本该属于我们的东西！
to reclaim what is rightfully ours!

3292415
00:54:52,415 --> 00:54:56,252
而且我们已做好不惜一切代价的准备！
And we are ready to do whatever it takes!

3296669
00:54:56,669 --> 00:54:59,964
如果没人耕种，就没人有饭吃。
If nobody farms, there will be no food for anyone.

3300381
00:55:00,381 --> 00:55:03,009
我们都会在地狱里用餐！
We will all dine in hell!

3303551
00:55:03,551 --> 00:55:05,219
所以，我最后一次恳求你们……
So, I ask you one last time...

3305511
00:55:05,511 --> 00:55:07,888
你们会打开谷仓门吗？！
will you open the barn door?!

3315229
00:55:15,229 --> 00:55:16,605
你们这群败类！
You low-lives!

3325906
00:55:25,906 --> 00:55:28,784
哼！把谷仓打开！
Hmph! Open the barn!

3363694
00:56:03,694 --> 00:56:04,779
当心！
Watch out!

3367990
00:56:07,990 --> 00:56:09,825
放我出去！救命！
Let me out! Help!

3371869
00:56:11,869 --> 00:56:15,998
救命！放我出去！
Help! Let me out!

3400606
00:56:40,606 --> 00:56:42,233
那是什么声音？
What's that noise?

3402608
00:56:42,608 --> 00:56:44,193
我去看看。
Let me check.

3405361
00:56:45,361 --> 00:56:47,905
是“愤怒”！救命！
It's a Wrath! Help!

3452533
00:57:32,533 --> 00:57:33,951
小妹，等我一下！
Yuri, wait for me!

3454034
00:57:34,034 --> 00:57:35,870
你在哪儿？
Where are you?

3456036
00:57:36,036 --> 00:57:38,747
健二！
Kenji!

3458831
00:57:38,831 --> 00:57:39,707
你在哪儿？
Where are you?

3459790
00:57:39,790 --> 00:57:41,250
健二！
Kenji!

3464003
00:57:44,003 --> 00:57:45,462
小妹！
Yuri!

3466046
00:57:46,046 --> 00:57:47,715
小妹！你去哪儿了？
Yuri! Where did you go?

3467798
00:57:47,798 --> 00:57:48,841
等我一下！
Wait for me!

3468924
00:57:48,924 --> 00:57:50,009
健二！
Kenji!

3470092
00:57:50,092 --> 00:57:51,092
小鬼！
Gudo!

3481645
00:58:01,645 --> 00:58:03,230
小妹！
Yuri!

3485107
00:58:05,107 --> 00:58:06,317
哇哦！
Oh, wow!

3488110
00:58:08,110 --> 00:58:10,196
这里真有趣！
This place is so interesting!

3493616
00:58:13,616 --> 00:58:14,616
走吧。
Come on.

3496744
00:58:16,744 --> 00:58:19,622
你在看什么？快起来！
What are you looking at? Get up!

3505753
00:58:25,753 --> 00:58:27,963
我想给你看点东西。
I'd like to show you something.

3538077
00:58:58,077 --> 00:59:01,413
所以……我早就死了吗？
So... am I long dead?

3543082
00:59:03,082 --> 00:59:06,210
你的身体只是个幻象。
Your body is just an illusion.

3546293
00:59:06,293 --> 00:59:08,963
这一切都是幻象吗？
It's all just an illusion?

3549088
00:59:09,088 --> 00:59:11,674
那我的死亡也是幻象吗？
So my death is also an illusion?

3552299
00:59:12,299 --> 00:59:15,010
死亡只是暂时的状态。
Death is just a temporary state.

3555094
00:59:15,094 --> 00:59:18,264
你会转世，重新活过来。
You will reincarnate and live again.

3558764
00:59:18,764 --> 00:59:21,308
那我记忆里的人呢？
What about those in my memories?

3561392
00:59:21,392 --> 00:59:23,435
只有你的情感是真实的。
Only your feelings are real.

3563519
00:59:23,519 --> 00:59:26,563
它们深藏在你的灵魂深处。
They hide deep in your soul.

3566814
00:59:26,814 --> 00:59:29,608
就像我想找到我弟弟那样吗？
Like how I want to find my little brother?

3570025
00:59:30,025 --> 00:59:31,193
那你呢？
How about you?

3571318
00:59:31,318 --> 00:59:32,486
咦？
Huh?

3572736
00:59:32,736 --> 00:59:34,405
你也是幻象吗？
Are you an illusion too?

3574738
00:59:34,738 --> 00:59:38,117
我是……
I am a...

3588627
00:59:48,627 --> 00:59:50,379
天女？！天女？！
Goddess?! Goddess?!

3592965
00:59:52,965 --> 00:59:55,384
发生了什么？我会救你的！
What happened? I'll save you!

3595634
00:59:55,634 --> 00:59:58,137
我以为我们已经拔除了邪恶之种！
I thought we'd pulled the seed of evil!

3598220
00:59:58,220 --> 01:00:02,433
这几千年以来，我依然未能根除人类的仇恨……
All these millennia, I still haven't eradicated human hatred...

3602599
01:00:02,599 --> 01:00:06,770
暴行、残忍、怨恨、敌意……
brutality, cruelty, resentment, hostility...

3606937
01:00:06,937 --> 01:00:09,773
“愤怒者”的邪恶已吞噬了人类，
The Wraths' evil have consumed humanity,

3609857
01:00:09,857 --> 01:00:12,568
因此“异世界”必须承受这一切。
so Another World must endure this.

3612651
01:00:12,651 --> 01:00:16,864
万物皆不可测，但它们只能继续前行。
All things are unfathomable, but they can only keep marching on.

3616947
01:00:16,947 --> 01:00:20,159
天女，没时间讲什么禅了！
Goddess, there's no time to talk zen!

3620242
01:00:20,242 --> 01:00:23,787
直奔主题！我们该怎么把你救出来？
Get to the point! How do we get you out?

3623996
01:00:23,996 --> 01:00:26,248
先解开小鬼的结，
Untie Gudo's knot first,

3626332
01:00:26,332 --> 01:00:30,127
奇迹就在前方。
a miracle awaits.

3637676
01:00:37,676 --> 01:00:39,428
小鬼，你的结在哪里？
Gudo, where is your knot?

3639511
01:00:39,511 --> 01:00:40,929
交出来！
Give it to me!

3641013
01:00:41,013 --> 01:00:42,598
我的结？
My knot?

3643265
01:00:43,265 --> 01:00:47,144
怎么回事？你的结是比喻吗？
What now? Is your knot metaphorical?

3647227
01:00:47,227 --> 01:00:48,896
我们现在该怎么办？
What should we do now?

3648979
01:00:48,979 --> 01:00:52,858
我不会解结，只会杀“愤怒者”。
I don't know how to untie knots, I only know how to kill Wraths.

3652941
01:00:52,941 --> 01:00:54,341
“另一个世界”到底怎么了？
What is happening to Another World?

3654401
01:00:54,401 --> 01:00:56,945
这些是逝去灵魂留下的红绳。
These are the red ropes left by deceased souls.

3657363
01:00:57,363 --> 01:00:59,740
当强村的村民们战斗时，
When Keung's villagers fought,

3659823
01:00:59,823 --> 01:01:01,283
有人变成了“愤怒”。
someone became a Wrath.

3661367
01:01:01,367 --> 01:01:02,785
大家都死了！
Everyone died!

3662868
01:01:02,868 --> 01:01:04,036
强村的人呢？
How about Keung?

3664119
01:01:04,119 --> 01:01:05,245
他们成功了吗？
Did they succeed?

3665329
01:01:05,329 --> 01:01:08,040
如果成功了，“另一个世界”就不会陷入困境了！
If they did, Another World wouldn't be in trouble!

3668123
01:01:08,123 --> 01:01:09,541
那天女呢？
And the Goddess?

3669625
01:01:09,625 --> 01:01:12,628
她被绳索缠住了，我无法斩断它们。
She's tangled up in the ropes, I can't sever them.

3672878
01:01:12,878 --> 01:01:14,963
她说我必须解开你的结。
She said I must untie your knot.

3675339
01:01:15,339 --> 01:01:17,716
小鬼，快想办法！
Gudo, think!

3677841
01:01:17,841 --> 01:01:20,969
我知道这对你来说很奇怪，毕竟你不是人类。
I know it is weird for you since you are not a human.

3681428
01:01:21,428 --> 01:01:24,848
但你有没有解开过绳结呢？
But is it possible that you have untied knots?

3710249
01:01:50,249 --> 01:01:51,917
准备好了吗？
Are you ready?

3726181
01:02:06,181 --> 01:02:07,641
小鬼……
Gudo...

3727724
01:02:07,724 --> 01:02:08,892
我会和你一起去的。
I will go with you.

3731937
01:02:11,937 --> 01:02:12,937
好！
Okay!

3759840
01:02:39,840 --> 01:02:41,967
求求你别拿走！
Please don't take it!

3762050
01:02:42,050 --> 01:02:43,510
还给我！
Give it back!

3764887
01:02:44,887 --> 01:02:45,971
滚开！
Beat it!

3807346
01:03:27,346 --> 01:03:28,680
健二……
Kenji...

3809181
01:03:29,181 --> 01:03:32,309
健二，张开嘴……
Kenji, open your mouth...

3812809
01:03:32,809 --> 01:03:34,520
你必须喝下去。
You have to drink.

3814603
01:03:34,603 --> 01:03:35,979
健二……
Kenji...

3818899
01:03:38,899 --> 01:03:40,275
健二……
Kenji...

3821735
01:03:41,735 --> 01:03:43,028
健二……
Kenji...

3826365
01:03:46,365 --> 01:03:47,824
健二……
Kenji...

3837834
01:03:57,834 --> 01:03:59,711
走开！
Go away!

3839795
01:03:59,795 --> 01:04:01,713
我们没有食物。
We don't have any food.

3891388
01:04:51,388 --> 01:04:52,514
健二。
Kenji.

3894474
01:04:54,474 --> 01:04:55,851
健二在哪里？
Where's Kenji?

3933764
01:05:33,764 --> 01:05:36,933
他的生命延长了你的生命。
His life extended your life.

3937017
01:05:37,017 --> 01:05:40,020
人类肚子饿了就必须吃饭。
Humans must eat when their tummies are hungry.

3940103
01:05:40,103 --> 01:05:42,439
你不必难过。
You don't have to be sad.

3943273
01:05:43,273 --> 01:05:47,152
但他是我弟弟啊！
But he's my brother!

3952824
01:05:52,824 --> 01:05:54,242
小妹！
Yuri!

3993907
01:06:33,907 --> 01:06:35,701
这是什么？
What is this?

3997661
01:06:37,661 --> 01:06:40,247
小妹！
Yuri!

4008130
01:06:48,130 --> 01:06:49,631
好烫啊！
It's so hot!

4013093
01:06:53,093 --> 01:06:56,972
你是小妹，肚子饿的时候你就是这样做的！
You're Yuri, you do this when your tummy's hungry!

4017514
01:06:57,514 --> 01:06:59,349
你是小妹，
You're Yuri,

4022060
01:07:02,060 --> 01:07:04,855
你妈妈可是个烹饪高手！
your mother is a great cook!

4025105
01:07:05,105 --> 01:07:06,523
小妹！
Yuri!

4027107
01:07:07,107 --> 01:07:13,321
你是小妹，你还得找到你弟弟并转世！
You're Yuri, you still have to find your brother and reincarnate!

4033780
01:07:13,780 --> 01:07:15,532
醒醒！
Wake up!

4065437
01:07:45,437 --> 01:07:48,732
小鬼，我这是怎么了？
Gudo, what is happening to me?

4069775
01:07:49,775 --> 01:07:51,568
我不知道。
I don't know.

4071902
01:07:51,902 --> 01:07:54,654
不过你现在没事了……
But you are fine now...

4075322
01:07:55,322 --> 01:07:57,616
小妹，你的邪恶种子
Yuri, your seed of evil

4077699
01:07:57,699 --> 01:07:59,326
终究在“另一个世界”发芽了。
has sprouted in Another World after all.

4083079
01:08:03,079 --> 01:08:06,249
看到真相后，
After seeing the truth,

4086333
01:08:06,333 --> 01:08:08,084
我以为她会转世。
I thought she would reincarnate.

4088168
01:08:08,168 --> 01:08:10,629
没想到，这反而触发了她向“愤怒”的蜕变。
Instead, it triggered her transformation into a Wrath.

4090712
01:08:10,712 --> 01:08:13,131
天女，小妹不是“愤怒”。
Goddess, Yuri is not a Wrath.

4093215
01:08:13,215 --> 01:08:14,883
她已经见到了弟弟。
She's seen her brother.

4094966
01:08:14,966 --> 01:08:17,052
我可以带她去转世。
I can take her to reincarnation.

4097135
01:08:17,135 --> 01:08:19,262
小鬼，你不明白。
Gudo, you don't understand.

4099346
01:08:19,346 --> 01:08:21,348
她的邪恶种子已经发芽了。
Her seed of evil has sprouted.

4101431
01:08:21,431 --> 01:08:23,809
带着邪恶种子的灵魂无法转世。
Souls with seeds of evil cannot reincarnate.

4103892
01:08:23,892 --> 01:08:27,395
不！我必须帮她转世！
No! I must help her reincarnate!

4107479
01:08:27,479 --> 01:08:30,065
小鬼……我们该怎么办？
Gudo... what should we do?

4110148
01:08:30,148 --> 01:08:32,234
我会带你去下一世！
I'll take you to your next life!

4112317
01:08:32,317 --> 01:08:34,444
你还能再见到弟弟！
You'll see your brother again!

4114528
01:08:34,528 --> 01:08:39,157
她不能留在异世界，也无法转世……
She cannot stay in Another World, and she cannot reincarnate...

4119449
01:08:39,449 --> 01:08:41,201
她只能留在这里……
she has to stay here...

4121493
01:08:41,493 --> 01:08:43,537
化作尘土……
and crumble into dust...

4136216
01:08:56,216 --> 01:08:57,425
小妹！
Yuri!

4138009
01:08:58,009 --> 01:08:59,219
天女！
Goddess!

4139553
01:08:59,553 --> 01:09:01,888
求求您帮帮她！
Please help her!

4158238
01:09:18,238 --> 01:09:19,489
小鬼！
Gudo!

4221343
01:10:21,343 --> 01:10:24,220
我们现在该怎么办？
What should we do now?

4239778
01:10:39,778 --> 01:10:41,863
哇啊……！哇啊……！
Waah...! Waah...!

4244240
01:10:44,240 --> 01:10:46,743
小鬼，你在做什么？
What are you doing, Gudo?

4247285
01:10:47,285 --> 01:10:50,288
我正试着像你一样哭呢。
I'm trying to cry like you.

4250372
01:10:50,372 --> 01:10:53,792
我好害怕再也见不到我的家人
I'm scared I'll never see my family

4253875
01:10:53,875 --> 01:10:55,710
和健二了……
and Kenji again...

4256753
01:10:56,753 --> 01:10:59,464
一想到再也见不到你……
When I think of never seeing you again...

4259547
01:10:59,547 --> 01:11:01,216
我就开始明白了。
I begin to understand.

4261675
01:11:01,675 --> 01:11:03,468
哇啊……！哇啊……！
Waah...! Waah...!

4286950
01:11:26,950 --> 01:11:28,827
健……二……
Ken... ji...

4300463
01:11:40,463 --> 01:11:42,007
他们还在这里吗？
Are they still here?

4302090
01:11:42,090 --> 01:11:43,090
不在了。
No.

4304509
01:11:44,509 --> 01:11:48,555
这里发生了什么？
What happened here?

4338460
01:12:18,460 --> 01:12:20,170
大地之母……
Mother Earth...

4341129
01:12:21,129 --> 01:12:24,340
为什么人们心中会有邪恶的种子？
why do people have seeds of evil?

4346426
01:12:26,426 --> 01:12:27,844
这一切都始于智慧……
It all started with wisdom...

4347927
01:12:27,927 --> 01:12:32,515
当人类开始区分善恶之时。
when human beings began to differentiate good from evil.

4352599
01:12:32,599 --> 01:12:37,353
所以人类是邪恶种子的源头吗？
So human beings are the source of the seed of evil?

4357479
01:12:37,479 --> 01:12:40,273
他们想要利用破坏的力量……
They wanted to use destructive powers...

4360356
01:12:40,356 --> 01:12:42,358
来纠正他们眼中的一切错误。
to right all that they saw as wrong.

4362484
01:12:42,484 --> 01:12:46,071
那么我们该如何消除他们心中的邪恶种子呢？
Then how do we remove their seeds of evil?

4367030
01:12:47,030 --> 01:12:49,991
当因缘消散时，万物便会瓦解。
All things come apart when causes and conditions dissipate.

4370075
01:12:50,075 --> 01:12:55,246
小妹想要转世，但她体内藏着一颗邪恶的种子。
Yuri wants to reincarnate, but she has a seed of evil in her.

4375538
01:12:55,538 --> 01:12:58,333
带着邪恶种子转世的灵魂……
Souls reincarnating with seeds of evil...

4378416
01:12:58,416 --> 01:13:01,294
必须经历一千年。
must live through a millennium.

4381920
01:13:01,920 --> 01:13:05,590
无论转世多少次，
No matter how many times they reincarnate,

4385673
01:13:05,673 --> 01:13:09,219
都会一直带着它吗？
they still carry it?

4401356
01:13:21,356 --> 01:13:22,440
小鬼，
Gudo,

4402524
01:13:22,524 --> 01:13:25,485
你听到了大地之母的话。
you heard what Mother Earth said.

4405610
01:13:25,610 --> 01:13:28,863
如果小妹的第二只邪恶之角长出来，
If Yuri's second evil horn grows,

4409280
01:13:29,280 --> 01:13:32,700
她的力量不仅会威胁人类世界……
her power will threaten not only the human world...

4413034
01:13:33,034 --> 01:13:36,037
还会威胁另一个世界。
but also Another World.

4420041
01:13:40,041 --> 01:13:43,378
但如果我从她每一世中拔除那颗邪恶的种子，
But if I pull the seeds of evil from each of her lives,

4423461
01:13:43,461 --> 01:13:47,507
一千年后她就能转世为普通人。
she can reincarnate into a normal person after a millennium.

4427757
01:13:47,757 --> 01:13:52,428
人会改变的。小妹已经长出一只邪恶之角了。
People change. Yuri already has one evil horn.

4432554
01:13:52,554 --> 01:13:55,098
你确定她的种子在
You're sure her seed won't sprout

4435181
01:13:55,181 --> 01:13:57,308
接下来的这一千年里不会发芽吗？
over the next millennium?

4437517
01:13:57,517 --> 01:13:59,602
我会一直陪在她身边！
I will stay with her!

4439727
01:13:59,727 --> 01:14:01,896
她每转世一次，
Every time she reincarnates,

4442063
01:14:02,063 --> 01:14:03,982
那颗种子的力量就会更强。
her seed grows more powerful.

4444065
01:14:04,065 --> 01:14:05,692
不过是一千年而已。
It's only 1,000 years.

4445775
01:14:05,775 --> 01:14:07,861
这绝非易事。
It will not be easy.

4447944
01:14:07,944 --> 01:14:09,028
我能做到的。
I can do it.

4449154
01:14:09,154 --> 01:14:12,824
如果小妹变成了“愤怒”，
If Yuri turns into a Wrath,

4452907
01:14:12,907 --> 01:14:16,536
你和小妹都会化为尘土……
both you and Yuri will crumble into dust...

4456619
01:14:16,619 --> 01:14:18,037
我绝不会放弃！
I won't give up!

4459873
01:14:19,873 --> 01:14:22,750
小鬼，你确定要这么做吗？
Are you sure you want to do this, Gudo?

4471926
01:14:31,926 --> 01:14:33,511
我对她有信心。
I have faith in her.

4474095
01:14:34,095 --> 01:14:38,141
小妹，如果你想救你的弟弟，
Yuri, if you want to save your little brother,

4478224
01:14:38,224 --> 01:14:40,393
就必须忘记他。
you must forget him.

4480852
01:14:40,852 --> 01:14:41,978
如果我放他走，
If I let him go,

4482061
01:14:42,061 --> 01:14:43,855
他就能得救吗？
he'll be saved?

4487817
01:14:47,817 --> 01:14:49,194
小妹，
Yuri,

4489694
01:14:49,694 --> 01:14:51,196
要想再见到他，
to see him again,

4491279
01:14:51,279 --> 01:14:53,823
你必须转世。
you have to reincarnate.

4493907
01:14:53,907 --> 01:14:55,617
要转世，
To reincarnate,

4495700
01:14:55,700 --> 01:14:58,077
你就必须忘记他。
you have to forget him.

4498161
01:14:58,161 --> 01:15:00,496
所以，转世是再见到他的唯一办法吗？
So, rebirth is the only way to see him again?

4508463
01:15:08,463 --> 01:15:10,840
我想转世！我要转世！
I want to be reborn! I want a rebirth!

4536658
01:15:36,658 --> 01:15:37,825
小鬼，
Gudo,

4537909
01:15:37,909 --> 01:15:41,454
记住你那千年的承诺。
remember your promise of a thousand years.

4541913
01:15:41,913 --> 01:15:42,913
我会的！
I will!

4613693
01:16:53,693 --> 01:16:55,278
这些是什么？
What are these?

4615611
01:16:55,611 --> 01:16:57,405
你的记忆。
Your memories.

4617947
01:16:57,947 --> 01:17:00,241
我好像没见过这些……
I don't think I've seen these...

4620575
01:17:00,575 --> 01:17:02,201
记忆太沉重了。
Memories are too heavy.

4622410
01:17:02,410 --> 01:17:04,787
你必须把它们留在这里。
You have to leave them here.

4625246
01:17:05,246 --> 01:17:06,748
否则……
Otherwise...

4627081
01:17:07,081 --> 01:17:09,459
你就无法渡过。
you cannot cross over.

4633671
01:17:13,671 --> 01:17:15,006
一旦渡过……
Once you cross...

4635131
01:17:15,131 --> 01:17:17,425
你就能再见到你的弟弟了。
you'll see your brother again.

4639010
01:17:19,010 --> 01:17:20,010
好！
Okay!

4699987
01:18:19,987 --> 01:18:21,531
等我。
Wait for me.

4732520
01:18:52,520 --> 01:18:54,188
我会忘记你吗？
Will I forget you?

4738359
01:18:58,359 --> 01:18:59,735
小妹，
Yuri,

4739944
01:18:59,944 --> 01:19:01,779
当你穿过瀑布之后，
after you pass the waterfall,

4741904
01:19:01,904 --> 01:19:03,614
你将进入下一世。
you will enter your next life.

4743781
01:19:03,781 --> 01:19:05,199
那你呢？
How about you?

4746659
01:19:06,659 --> 01:19:08,244
我保证……
I promise...

4748828
01:19:08,828 --> 01:19:09,996
无论你去哪里，
no matter where you go,

4750079
01:19:10,079 --> 01:19:11,330
我都会找到你。
I'll find you.

4764677
01:19:24,677 --> 01:19:26,179
我会记得你吗？
Will I remember you?

4766721
01:19:26,721 --> 01:19:28,639
我该怎么认出你？
How will I recognize you?

4804675
01:20:04,675 --> 01:20:06,093
小鬼！
Gudo!

4810806
01:20:10,806 --> 01:20:13,684
在下一千年里，
In the next millennium,

4813768
01:20:13,768 --> 01:20:15,603
无论你走到哪里……
no matter where you go...

4816062
01:20:16,062 --> 01:20:18,064
我都会找到你。
I'll find you.

4818564
01:20:18,564 --> 01:20:19,607
我保证……
I promise...

4820316
01:20:20,316 --> 01:20:22,693
我一定会找到你。
I will find you.

4968923
01:22:48,923 --> 01:22:50,508
所以，古兰和姜
So, both Goran and Keung

4970591
01:22:50,591 --> 01:22:52,635
都是小妹的转世。
are Yuri's reincarnations.

4973010
01:22:53,010 --> 01:22:55,096
而且在他们之前还有其他人。
And there were others before them.

4975429
01:22:55,429 --> 01:22:58,432
我记得他们。所以，已经过去了一千年……
I remember them. So, a millennium has passed...

4978724
01:22:58,724 --> 01:23:01,519
灵魂守护者不能如此频繁地进入人间。
Soul Keepers cannot enter the human world so many times.

4981602
01:23:01,602 --> 01:23:03,145
这就是你如此虚弱的原因……
That's why you are so weak...

4983562
01:23:03,562 --> 01:23:05,439
我们有过约定。
We have a pact.

4986524
01:23:06,524 --> 01:23:08,943
但她不认得你……
But she doesn't recognize you...

4989402
01:23:09,402 --> 01:23:12,363
我认得她，我们有过约定！
I recognize her, we have a pact!

4992446
01:23:12,446 --> 01:23:13,656
如果问我的话，
If you ask me,

4993739
01:23:13,739 --> 01:23:15,908
我会说你在浪费时间。
I'd say you're wasting your time.

4995991
01:23:15,991 --> 01:23:18,411
没冒犯的意思，但我另有目的。
No offense, but I have an ulterior motive.

4998494
01:23:18,494 --> 01:23:20,287
哈！你这个模仿者！
Ha! You copycat!

5000746
01:23:20,746 --> 01:23:22,164
我会找到她的。
I will find her.

5002248
01:23:22,248 --> 01:23:25,000
这是她在这千年里的最后一次转世。
This is her last life in the millennium.

5006293
01:23:26,293 --> 01:23:29,130
我终于明白了！她就是你的“结”！
I get it now! She's your "knot"!

5009255
01:23:29,255 --> 01:23:31,507
但如果你这次死了呢？
But what if you die this time?

5011799
01:23:31,799 --> 01:23:33,342
值得吗？
Is it worth it?

5013551
01:23:33,551 --> 01:23:36,137
你会化为尘土。
You'll crumble into dust.

5016220
01:23:36,220 --> 01:23:38,347
我向天女发誓要保护你。
I promised Goddess to protect you.

5018597
01:23:38,597 --> 01:23:41,934
我头好痛，明明我根本没有头！
My head hurts, and I'm headless!

5023018
01:23:43,018 --> 01:23:44,103
如果人类可以转世，
If humans can reincarnate,

5024186
01:23:44,186 --> 01:23:47,606
而我化为尘土，
and if I crumble into dust,

5027690
01:23:47,690 --> 01:23:50,317
我的“结”会回到米山吗？
will my knot return to Mount Mi?

5030401
01:23:50,401 --> 01:23:51,569
要我說的話，
If you ask me,

5031652
01:23:51,652 --> 01:23:53,946
化为尘土就意味着什么都不剩了。
I'd say crumbling into dust means nothing's left.

5036407
01:23:56,407 --> 01:23:58,451
如果小妹变成了“愤怒”，
If Yuri turns into a Wrath,

5038534
01:23:58,534 --> 01:24:00,911
我该怎么办？
what should I do?

5041996
01:24:01,996 --> 01:24:04,123
你会阻止她的！
You'll stop her!

5045249
01:24:05,249 --> 01:24:08,335
但先警告你，如果她变成了“愤怒”，
But fair warning, if she turns into a Wrath,

5048419
01:24:08,419 --> 01:24:10,546
我必须杀了她。
I have to kill her.

5059305
01:24:19,305 --> 01:24:22,641
我相信她不会变成“愤怒”的。
I have faith that she won't turn into a Wrath.

5063017
01:24:23,017 --> 01:24:24,226
那我们走吧。
Then let's go.

5064852
01:24:24,852 --> 01:24:26,729
你可是立过誓约的！
You have a pact!

5067938
01:24:27,938 --> 01:24:30,024
而且我必须拯救天女。
And I have to save Goddess.

5079492
01:24:39,492 --> 01:24:41,744
吃点东西吧，不然你会饿死的！
Eat something, or you'll starve!

5081827
01:24:41,827 --> 01:24:44,455
但我只喜欢你做的饭。
But I only like your cooking.

5084663
01:24:44,663 --> 01:24:46,916
你只是拿我的食物喂你的猫罢了。
You're just using my food to feed your cat.

5086999
01:24:46,999 --> 01:24:48,751
走吧！回去工作！
Let's go! Back to work!

5098552
01:24:58,552 --> 01:25:03,557
看，烟囱里冒出来的东西看起来像我的头发。
Look, the stuff from the chimneys look like my hair.

5107978
01:25:07,978 --> 01:25:10,940
我不是让你在“另一个世界”好好休息一下了吗？
I told you to get some rest in Another World.

5113651
01:25:13,651 --> 01:25:16,195
你没必要一直待在这里
You don't need to be here all the time

5116278
01:25:16,278 --> 01:25:18,823
把自己累垮。
and exhaust yourself.

5118906
01:25:18,906 --> 01:25:24,662
我没事，我想看看英工作时的样子。
I'll be fine, I want to see Ying at work.

5124745
01:25:24,745 --> 01:25:26,247
有什么好看的？
What's there to see?

5126330
01:25:26,330 --> 01:25:29,083
她们只是站在那里织布而已。
They just stand there and weave.

5129166
01:25:29,166 --> 01:25:30,626
可是……
But...

5131710
01:25:31,710 --> 01:25:34,380
行吧，等会儿我带你去那里。
Fine, I'll take you there later.

5135464
01:25:35,464 --> 01:25:39,885
我闻到那边有“愤怒”的气息，黑天……
I can smell a Wrath over there, Dark Sky...

5140052
01:25:40,052 --> 01:25:41,387
你真是没用！
You're so useless!

5143013
01:25:43,013 --> 01:25:44,473
你在干什么？
What are you doing?

5144557
01:25:44,557 --> 01:25:46,892
你的活儿没一样合格的！
None of your work passes muster!

5147059
01:25:47,059 --> 01:25:48,811
你把机器弄坏了！
You're breaking the machine!

5148894
01:25:48,894 --> 01:25:50,396
做不到就滚开！
Scram if you're not up to it!

5150479
01:25:50,479 --> 01:25:52,022
别拖我们后腿！
Don't drag us down!

5152147
01:25:52,147 --> 01:25:54,316
马克，你这是怎么了？
Mark, what's with you?

5154525
01:25:54,525 --> 01:25:55,442
主管不在
The supervisor's absence

5155526
01:25:55,526 --> 01:25:56,777
不代表你就能当家作主！
doesn't mean you're in charge!

5156861
01:25:56,861 --> 01:25:58,320
总是你们两个！
It's always you two!

5158404
01:25:58,404 --> 01:25:59,947
都是因为你们，我们的餐券才被削减了！
You're why they cut our meal tickets!

5160030
01:26:00,030 --> 01:26:01,949
听见了吗？
You hear that?

5162283
01:26:02,283 --> 01:26:03,617
别理他。
Don't listen to him.

5163701
01:26:03,701 --> 01:26:05,786
我们会修好的，管好你自己的事！
We'll fix them, mind your own business!

5165870
01:26:05,870 --> 01:26:06,870
娜娜……
Nana...

5166912
01:26:06,912 --> 01:26:09,832
没错，你们无能跟我们没关系！
Exactly, your incompetence shouldn't be our business!

5169915
01:26:09,915 --> 01:26:12,209
但我们全都因此挨饿！
But we all starve because of it!

5172293
01:26:12,293 --> 01:26:13,085
说得对！
That's right!

5173168
01:26:13,168 --> 01:26:14,712
别拖我们后腿了！
Stop dragging us down!

5174962
01:26:14,962 --> 01:26:16,839
他们能去哪儿？
Where can they go?

5176922
01:26:16,922 --> 01:26:18,465
他们跟我们一样……
They are just like us...

5178549
01:26:18,549 --> 01:26:19,693
被卖到这里当童工的。
sold to be child workers here.

5179717
01:26:19,717 --> 01:26:21,468
哈迪，你想当英雄吗？
Hardy, you wanna be a hero?

5181552
01:26:21,552 --> 01:26:22,553
搞完了吗？
Are you done?

5182636
01:26:22,636 --> 01:26:24,430
——你们这群恶霸！——娜娜，别……
-You bullies! -Nana, stop...

5184597
01:26:24,597 --> 01:26:26,307
你们这群臭孤儿！
You stinking orphans!

5186557
01:26:26,557 --> 01:26:28,017
你打我了！
You hit me!

5189393
01:26:29,393 --> 01:26:30,853
住手！
Stop!

5193272
01:26:33,272 --> 01:26:35,691
娜娜，别理他们……
Nana, just ignore them...

5196025
01:26:36,025 --> 01:26:38,152
说完了吗？别管我们！
Are you done? Leave us alone!

5200321
01:26:40,321 --> 01:26:41,530
这都是你的错！
It's all because of you!

5201614
01:26:41,614 --> 01:26:42,614
住手！住手！
Stop! Stop!

5202656
01:26:42,656 --> 01:26:44,325
别伤害我姐姐！
Don't hurt my sister!

5213125
01:26:53,125 --> 01:26:54,710
住手，马克！
Stop, Mark!

5216045
01:26:56,045 --> 01:26:57,504
退后！
Back off!

5230976
01:27:10,976 --> 01:27:11,769
娜娜！
Nana!

5231852
01:27:11,852 --> 01:27:13,604
英，别动！
Ying, stay where you are!

5235230
01:27:15,230 --> 01:27:16,982
退后！
Stay back!

5237942
01:27:17,942 --> 01:27:19,860
有“愤怒”组织？我应该知道。
There's a Wrath? I would know.

5239944
01:27:19,944 --> 01:27:21,320
那只是英的工厂。
It's just Ying's factory.

5241403
01:27:21,403 --> 01:27:22,403
去看看吧。
Go take a look.

5242988
01:27:22,988 --> 01:27:24,239
英！
Ying!

5255668
01:27:35,668 --> 01:27:36,877
娜娜！
Nana!

5257920
01:27:37,920 --> 01:27:38,921
好烫啊！
That's so hot!

5262049
01:27:42,049 --> 01:27:43,258
娜娜！
Nana!

5265302
01:27:45,302 --> 01:27:46,428
娜娜！
Nana!

5266804
01:27:46,804 --> 01:27:50,057
这边！小心点！
This way! Be careful!

5311056
01:28:31,056 --> 01:28:32,391
娜娜？
Nana?

5328157
01:28:48,157 --> 01:28:50,617
我姐姐为什么会死？
Why did my sister die?

5332202
01:28:52,202 --> 01:28:54,038
是因为我吗？
Is it because of me?

5335330
01:28:55,330 --> 01:28:57,791
都是我的错！
It's because of me!

5340294
01:29:00,294 --> 01:29:02,880
是我杀了我的姐姐！
I killed my sister!

5361982
01:29:21,982 --> 01:29:23,650
着火了！救命！
Fire! Help!

5366153
01:29:26,153 --> 01:29:27,488
英！
Ying!

5367738
01:29:27,738 --> 01:29:29,114
情况突然变得很严重！
That escalated quickly!

5369323
01:29:29,323 --> 01:29:31,700
英，你在哪儿？
Where are you, Ying?

5371784
01:29:31,784 --> 01:29:33,035
英！
Ying!

5375913
01:29:35,913 --> 01:29:39,750
英，你在干什么？快走！
Ying, what are you doing? Let's go!

5379833
01:29:39,833 --> 01:29:42,795
这里很危险。
It's dangerous here.

5388425
01:29:48,425 --> 01:29:49,968
英！
Ying!

5390052
01:29:50,052 --> 01:29:52,262
你还记得这个吗？
Do you remember this?

5392346
01:29:52,346 --> 01:29:54,181
别变成“愤怒”！
Don't turn into a Wrath!

5394264
01:29:54,264 --> 01:29:56,725
你的名字是小妹！你还记得吗？
Your name is Yuri! Do you remember?

5396809
01:29:56,809 --> 01:30:00,729
我是小鬼！你还记得吗？
I'm Gudo! Do you remember?

5400896
01:30:00,896 --> 01:30:04,691
我们离成功这么近了！醒醒！
We're so close! Wake up!

5405150
01:30:05,150 --> 01:30:07,528
醒醒，小妹！
Wake up, Yuri!

5407986
01:30:07,986 --> 01:30:11,740
我答应过我们会一起找到你的弟弟！
I promised we'd find your brother together!

5411824
01:30:11,824 --> 01:30:15,202
健二……
Kenji...

5416036
01:30:16,036 --> 01:30:18,163
小妹，你还记得我吗？
Do you remember me, Yuri?

5424419
01:30:24,419 --> 01:30:25,420
对不起，小鬼！
I'm sorry, Gudo!

5425504
01:30:25,504 --> 01:30:27,422
她已经不是小妹了！
She's no longer Yuri!

5441436
01:30:41,436 --> 01:30:44,273
小妹，不要！
Yuri, no!

5448026
01:30:48,026 --> 01:30:49,278
小妹！
Yuri!

5450237
01:30:50,237 --> 01:30:51,738
小妹！
Yuri!

5464293
01:31:04,293 --> 01:31:06,044
喂，你听见了吗？
Hey, can you hear that?

5468130
01:31:08,130 --> 01:31:09,130
看……
Look...

5469173
01:31:09,173 --> 01:31:10,299
那是……
that's...

5476638
01:31:16,638 --> 01:31:18,557
小妹，你必须停下来！
Yuri, you have to stop!

5482978
01:31:22,978 --> 01:31:25,606
黑天，不要……
Dark Sky, no...

5485981
01:31:25,981 --> 01:31:27,232
我们还有机会……
We still have a chance...

5491236
01:31:31,236 --> 01:31:32,946
停下，小妹！
Stop, Yuri!

5506877
01:31:46,877 --> 01:31:48,462
别逼我！
Don't force my hand!

5514885
01:31:54,885 --> 01:31:56,303
不……不……
Na... na...

5525145
01:32:05,145 --> 01:32:07,231
我真的会杀了你！
I really will kill you!

5542829
01:32:22,829 --> 01:32:23,829
清醒点！
Snap out of it!

5545374
01:32:25,374 --> 01:32:26,917
看来就这样了！
I guess that's it!

5551004
01:32:31,004 --> 01:32:33,548
不，黑天！她还是人类！
No, Dark Sky! She's still human!

5554174
01:32:34,174 --> 01:32:36,343
让开！
Get out of my way!

5566687
01:32:46,687 --> 01:32:48,689
小鬼，你为什么要拦我？！
Gudo, why'd you stop me?!

5568772
01:32:48,772 --> 01:32:50,983
如果现在不杀死“愤怒”，
If we don't kill the Wrath now,

5571066
01:32:51,066 --> 01:32:53,735
人类世界和异世界都会被毁灭！
both the human world and Another World will be destroyed!

5573819
01:32:53,819 --> 01:32:55,445
我们错失良机了！
We missed our chance!

5575529
01:32:55,529 --> 01:32:58,365
因为你天真地以为能救她！
Because you were naïve enough to think you can save her!

5578448
01:32:58,448 --> 01:33:01,910
你把我的剑弄断了！难道我要徒手和她战斗吗？
You broke my sword! Should I fight her with my bare hands?

5581994
01:33:01,994 --> 01:33:03,745
睁大眼睛好好看看！
Open your eyes and take a look!

5583829
01:33:03,829 --> 01:33:05,706
她看起来像人类吗？
Does she look like a human to you?

5585789
01:33:05,789 --> 01:33:07,791
她或许看起来像小妹或英，
She may look like Yuri or Ying,

5587874
01:33:07,874 --> 01:33:09,793
但她现在已经是“愤怒”了。
but she's a Wrath now.

5589876
01:33:09,876 --> 01:33:11,169
如果她的邪恶犄角被封印，
If her evil horns are sealed,

5591253
01:33:11,253 --> 01:33:12,629
一切就都完了！
it's all over!

5592713
01:33:12,713 --> 01:33:15,340
不只是这里！“异世界”和“天女”也会完蛋！
Not just this place! Another World and Goddess, too!

5595424
01:33:15,424 --> 01:33:16,550
算了！
Forget this!

5597676
01:33:17,676 --> 01:33:22,514
小妹……别变成“愤怒”……
Yuri... Don't turn into a Wrath...

5602597
01:33:22,597 --> 01:33:24,725
你还记得吗？
Do you remember?

5608353
01:33:28,353 --> 01:33:30,272
我知道你想干什么！
I know what you are trying to do!

5610355
01:33:30,355 --> 01:33:32,149
住手！
Stop!

5620866
01:33:40,866 --> 01:33:43,493
你这副骨架，怎么这么沉？
Why are you so heavy, you bag of bones?

5635380
01:33:55,380 --> 01:33:57,799
把那对邪恶的犄角砍下来！
Let's chop those evil horns off!

5644348
01:34:04,348 --> 01:34:05,474
黑天……
Dark Sky...

5653732
01:34:13,732 --> 01:34:17,277
小鬼！如果你能回到异世界见到天女……
Gudo! If you make it back to Another World and see Goddess...

5657652
01:34:17,652 --> 01:34:18,904
一定要告诉她……
you have to tell her...

5659196
01:34:19,196 --> 01:34:22,115
我已经竭尽全力保护你了！
I did my best to protect you!

5688183
01:34:48,183 --> 01:34:49,476
对不起，小鬼。
Sorry, Gudo.

5689559
01:34:49,559 --> 01:34:51,937
我现在必须杀了她！
I have to kill her now!

5703490
01:35:03,490 --> 01:35:06,952
这家伙真难对付。
This thing's a tough one.

5752372
01:35:52,372 --> 01:35:53,790
小妹……
Yuri...

5755792
01:35:55,792 --> 01:35:57,836
别这样！
Don't do this!

5764259
01:36:04,259 --> 01:36:07,304
我是小鬼……
I'm Gudo...

5770307
01:36:10,307 --> 01:36:12,934
你还记得我吗？
Do you remember me?

5773477
01:36:13,477 --> 01:36:14,895
这一切都是值得的。
It's worth it.

5778356
01:36:18,356 --> 01:36:24,029
这千年……全都值得了！
These thousand years... was all worth it!

5792245
01:36:32,245 --> 01:36:34,498
我是谁？
Who am I?

5796708
01:36:36,708 --> 01:36:38,126
小妹。
Yuri.

5799085
01:36:39,085 --> 01:36:40,295
小妹？
Yuri?

5804132
01:36:44,132 --> 01:36:46,218
我是谁？
Who am I?

5808386
01:36:48,386 --> 01:36:51,932
穿过瀑布后，你将进入下一世。
After you pass the waterfall, you will enter your next life.

5812557
01:36:52,557 --> 01:36:53,892
那你呢？
How about you?

5813975
01:36:53,975 --> 01:36:57,479
我保证，无论你去哪里，我都会找到你。
I promise, wherever you go, I will find you.

5817771
01:36:57,771 --> 01:36:59,439
我会记得你吗？
Will I remember you?

5822943
01:37:02,943 --> 01:37:07,239
你叫小妹，死在了一座山上。
Your name is Yuri, you died on a mountain.

5827697
01:37:07,697 --> 01:37:11,618
那时你正在寻找你的弟弟。
You were looking for your little brother then.

5834246
01:37:14,246 --> 01:37:15,246
我的弟弟……
My little brother...

5844839
01:37:24,839 --> 01:37:26,299
我的弟弟……
My little brother...

5846758
01:37:26,758 --> 01:37:31,054
我吃了……
I ate...

5851846
01:37:31,846 --> 01:37:32,846
我……
I...

5852889
01:37:32,889 --> 01:37:35,141
我吃了我的弟弟？
I ate my little brother?

5856101
01:37:36,101 --> 01:37:37,936
你必须原谅自己！
You have to forgive yourself!

5858562
01:37:38,562 --> 01:37:43,483
只有这样，我才能消除你心中的邪恶种子。
That's the only way I can take away your seed of evil.

5863900
01:37:43,900 --> 01:37:47,487
小妹，别自责了！
Yuri, don't blame yourself!

5867779
01:37:47,779 --> 01:37:50,282
那是命运的安排！
They're acts of fate!

5870365
01:37:50,365 --> 01:37:54,077
我记起来了！我杀了那么多人！
I remember now! I killed so many people!

5875453
01:37:55,453 --> 01:37:58,164
那么多人因为我而死去！
So many died because of me!

5878248
01:37:58,248 --> 01:38:00,625
我杀了那么多人！
I killed so many people!

5880709
01:38:00,709 --> 01:38:02,919
我真是个恶人！
I'm an evil person!

5884754
01:38:04,754 --> 01:38:07,841
不是你把他们送上死路！
You didn't send them to their deaths!

5890969
01:38:10,969 --> 01:38:14,889
只是你没能救下他们罢了！
You just couldn't save them!

5894973
01:38:14,973 --> 01:38:18,518
我不配得到宽恕……
I'm not worthy of forgiveness...

5908820
01:38:28,820 --> 01:38:30,322
小妹！
Yuri!

5910405
01:38:30,405 --> 01:38:34,200
看看你的双手，你正抓着谁？
Look at your hands, who are you grabbing?

5914284
01:38:34,284 --> 01:38:37,287
看看你抓着的是谁！
Look at who you're grabbing!

5919831
01:38:39,831 --> 01:38:41,207
小妹！
Yuri!

5921291
01:38:41,291 --> 01:38:44,753
看看你抓着的是谁！
Look at who you're grabbing!

5937474
01:38:57,474 --> 01:38:58,642
健二？
Kenji?

5961081
01:39:21,081 --> 01:39:26,211
英救了你……是我在这辈子救了你吗？
Ying saved you... I saved you in this life?

5971549
01:39:31,549 --> 01:39:35,053
我有资格给予救赎吗？
Am I qualified to offer salvation?

5981393
01:39:41,393 --> 01:39:45,647
任何人都能给予救赎，
Anyone can offer salvation,

5987273
01:39:47,273 --> 01:39:51,945
你只需要相信时间，相信自己。
you just need to have faith in time and yourself.

5992612
01:39:52,612 --> 01:39:58,159
你心中有仁慈，只是把它忘了。
You have kindness in you, you just forgot about it.

6070064
01:41:10,064 --> 01:41:12,567
“愤怒”的气息消失了……
The aura of the Wrath is gone...

6096341
01:41:36,341 --> 01:41:39,803
英！英……
Ying! Ying...

6106059
01:41:46,059 --> 01:41:47,894
英！你没事吧？
Ying! Are you all right?

6112524
01:41:52,524 --> 01:41:54,526
我认出你了……
I recognize you...

6115902
01:41:55,902 --> 01:41:59,405
你还记得我吗？没错，是我，哈迪！
You remember me? That's right, it's Hardy!

6125912
01:42:05,912 --> 01:42:09,249
我已经找了你一千年了！
I've been looking for you for a thousand years!

6135380
01:42:15,380 --> 01:42:19,592
小鬼，喂……
Gudo, hey...

6139676
01:42:19,676 --> 01:42:24,556
古……小鬼……
Gu... Gudo...

6145974
01:42:25,974 --> 01:42:28,393
小鬼，坚持住！
Gudo, hang in there!

6158862
01:42:38,862 --> 01:42:40,530
没时间了！
There's no time!

6162740
01:42:42,740 --> 01:42:44,909
已经太迟了！
It's too late!

6180842
01:43:00,842 --> 01:43:02,302
小鬼，
Gudo,

6182927
01:43:02,927 --> 01:43:05,722
异世界的所有结都已解开。
all the knots in Another World have been untied.

6187056
01:43:07,056 --> 01:43:08,516
天女。
Goddess.

6189058
01:43:09,058 --> 01:43:12,729
这意味着我很快就会化为尘土了吗？
Does that mean I'll soon crumble into dust?

6192812
01:43:12,812 --> 01:43:14,063
小鬼……
Gudo...

6195315
01:43:15,315 --> 01:43:16,858
小鬼……
Gudo...

6200570
01:43:20,570 --> 01:43:21,654
小鬼……
Gudo...

6201738
01:43:21,738 --> 01:43:23,615
我们曾立下誓约。
we made a pact.

6203698
01:43:23,698 --> 01:43:25,783
我从未忘记你。
I didn't forget about you.

6214334
01:43:34,334 --> 01:43:37,045
你现在会哭了！
You know how to cry now!

6217211
01:43:37,211 --> 01:43:41,174
天女，小妹能重新成为普通人吗？
Goddess, can Yuri be a normal person again?

6221257
01:43:41,257 --> 01:43:43,092
她现在可以转世了吗？
Can she reincarnate now?

6223176
01:43:43,176 --> 01:43:44,218
是的。
Yes.

6226429
01:43:46,429 --> 01:43:49,557
我现在既不能待在人间……
I can't be in the human world...

6229849
01:43:49,849 --> 01:43:52,644
也不能待在异世界了。
nor Another World now.

6233227
01:43:53,227 --> 01:43:57,023
一切都结束了。
It's all over.

6237857
01:43:57,857 --> 01:43:59,859
还有另一种方法。
There's another way.

6240109
01:44:00,109 --> 01:44:03,988
你可以转世，成为一个普通人。
You can reincarnate and become a human being.

6254791
01:44:14,791 --> 01:44:17,543
我必须忘记……
Do I have to forget...

6265093
01:44:25,093 --> 01:44:31,057
过去的一千年吗？
the past millennium?

6283653
01:44:43,653 --> 01:44:48,491
原来离别的悲伤是这种感觉……
So this is how the sorrow of parting feels...

6294080
01:44:54,080 --> 01:44:58,751
我现在明白了。
I get it now.

6369864
01:46:09,864 --> 01:46:13,326
另一个世界
ANOTHER WORLD

6391385
01:46:31,385 --> 01:46:35,223
如果问我的话，我会说你在浪费时间。
If you ask me, I'd say you're wasting your time.

6398601
01:46:38,601 --> 01:46:42,105
没关系，我会从这里守护着他。
It's okay, I'll watch over him from here.
